Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:04.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《教父》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.29,0:01:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信美国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国使我发了财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}America has made my fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我以美国方式教养我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I raised my daughter in the American fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给她自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give her freedom, but I taught her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也告诉她永远不要有辱家门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}never to dishonor her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她交了位男友但不是意大利人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She found a boyfriend. Not an Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟他去看电影 深夜才回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went to the movies with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有责骂她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stayed out late. I didn't protest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个月前他与另一个男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two months ago, he took her for a drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.90,0:01:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去兜风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with another boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们强灌她喝威士忌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made her drink whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们想要占她便宜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they tried to take advantage of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:02:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她抵抗 她保住了名节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She resisted.She kept her honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.09,0:02:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他们像对动物般的毒打她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they beat her like an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我到医院时 她的鼻梁断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I went to the hospital, her nose was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的下巴被打碎了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}her jaw was shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须用钢丝绑着才不会掉下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}held together by wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她痛得不能哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She couldn't even weep because of the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却哭了 我为什么哭呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wept. Why did I weep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.41,0:02:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我视她如珠如宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the light of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她长得很美丽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她再也美丽不起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she will never be beautiful again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去报警 像个守法的美国人一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the police like a good American.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个男孩受到了审判{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These two boys were brought to trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,法官判他们有期徒刑三年但缓刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ajudge sentence them to three years in prison and suspend their sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,缓刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspended sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当天就没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went free that very day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像个傻瓜似的站在法庭中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stood in the courtroom like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那两个混蛋竟朝着我笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those two bastard, they smiled at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我对我太太说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I said to my wife, "For justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为求公道 我们必须去找柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must go to Don Corleone."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.45,0:03:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去报警前为何不先来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you go to the police? Why didn't you come to me first?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管吩咐 但求你一定要帮我这个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me anything, but do what I beg you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你什么忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个我办不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I cannot do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么 我都会给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you anything you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相识多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've known each other many years, but this is the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第一次来找我帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ever came to me for counsel or for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记不起你上次是何时 请我到你家去喝咖啡了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember the last time that you invited me to your house for a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,何况我太太还是你独生女的教母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though my wife is godmother to your only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坦白说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来就不想要我的友谊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never wanted my friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你害怕欠我人情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were afraid to be in my debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想卷入是非{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to get into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在美国发了财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found paradise in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,生意做的很好 生活过的很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a good trade, made a good living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警察和法律保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police protected you, and there were courts of law.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要我这种朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you didn't need a friend like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在你来找我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you come to me and you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下 请帮我主持公道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don Corleone, give me justice."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.93,0:05:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你对我一点尊重也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't ask with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不把我当朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't offer friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至不愿意喊我教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even think to call me "Godfather."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我女儿结婚当天来我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, you come into my house on the day my daughter is to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,用钱收买我为你杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you ask me to do murder for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是要求你主持公道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是公道 你女儿还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not justice. Your daughter is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么让他们像她一样受折磨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must suffer then as she suffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该付你多少钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much shall I pay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,包纳萨拉 包纳萨拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonasera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底我做了什么让你这么的不尊重我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I ever done to make you treat me so disrespectfully?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你以朋友身分来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd come to me in friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么伤害你女儿的杂碎 就会受到折磨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the scum that ruined your daughter would be suffering this very day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种诚实人的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if, by chance an honest man like yourself should make enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是我的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then they would become my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 他们就会害怕你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they would fear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他日我或许需要你的帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday, and that day may never come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能不会有那么一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call upon you to do a service for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那一天到来之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,收下这份公道做为小女结婚之礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}accept this justice as a gift on my daughter's wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 教父 别客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grazie, Godfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事交给… 克里曼沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give this to Clemenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用可康娜送纺郧逍训娜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want reliable people people that aren't going to be carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是谋杀犯 下手别太重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're not murderers in spite of what this undertaker says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克在哪？- 别担心 他一会就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Michael? - What? Don't worry. It's early. He'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:08:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有麦克我不照相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会再拍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not taking the picture without Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 麦克的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the matter, Sonny? - It's Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 巴西尼阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Barzini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得我儿子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 让我喝点酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Paulie! Let me have some wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.61,0:09:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 再来点酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paulie! More wine. Scusi, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来棒极了 你是裁判还是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look "terrif" on the floor. What are you, a dance judge or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开吧 到附近晃晃做你的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go take a walk around the neighborhood. Do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙杜拉 帮个忙 别让孩子乱跑 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandra, come on. Do me a favor. Watch the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看好你自己 - 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't let 'em run wild. - You watch yourself, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,两三万元小钞 全是现金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty or thirty grand. In small bills, cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,全在那个小丝袋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that little silk purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是我的婚礼我就发财了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this was somebody else's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 接住吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Paulie! I got two gobbagool gabagol and a prosciutto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得回去工作了 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have to go back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.57,0:10:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是婚礼的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有西西里人在女儿结婚那天 能拒绝任何的请求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Sicilian can refuse any request on his daughter's wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下能受邀到贵府 深感荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone, I am honored and grateful that you have invited me to your home-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么？滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是私人宴会 快滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a private party. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么？是我妹妹的婚礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Hey, my sister's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的联邦密探什么都不尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn FBI don't respect nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这 到这来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here, come here. Come here!There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最后他获假释去为美国作战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But towards the end he was paroled to help with the American war effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去六个月他在我的糕饼店做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the last six months, he's been working at my pastry shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳色利 我的朋友 我能为你做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazorine, my friend, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在战争结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that the war is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这男孩 安索 他们要把他遣返意大利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this boy, Enzo, they want to repatriate him back to Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父 我有个女儿她和安索…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godfather, I have a daughter. See, she and Enzo-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要安索留在这个国家 和你女儿成亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want Enzo to stay in this country and you want your daughter to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都了解 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈金先生 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Hagen. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会看看我为你女儿 做的结婚蛋糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wait till you see the beautiful wedding cake I made for your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么高… 还有一对新人和天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this, with the bride and the groom and-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这件事我该交给谁去办？- 别给我们这个选区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who should I give this job to? - Not to our paisan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给别地区的犹太籍众议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to a Jew congressman in another district.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,名单上还有谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else is on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 麦克 最近怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Michael. How are you? Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,路卡布拉西不在名单上 但他想要见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not on the list, but Luca Brasi wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个有这个必要吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没料到会受邀参加婚礼 所以要向你致谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't expect to be invited to the wedding so he wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下 在令媛婚礼这天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone, I am honored and grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,能受邀到贵府深感荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have invited me to your home on the wedding day of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他们早生贵子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may their first child be a masculine child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的那个人在自言自语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man over there is talking to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那边那个吓人的家伙了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that scary guy over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很叫人害怕 他是谁？叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very scary guy.Who is he? What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫做路卡布拉西 有时候替家父办事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Luca Brasi and he helps my father out sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 等一下 他过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. He's coming over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,家兄汤姆哈金 这是凯亚当斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother Tom Hagen. This is Kay Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do? Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲要见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's been asking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸会 - 幸会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very nice to meet you. - Nice to meet you.I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他是你哥哥 为何不同姓？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's your brother, why does he have a different name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候在街上发现汤姆无家可归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my brother Sonny was a kid he found Tom Hagen in the street, and he had no home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.93,0:14:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以家父收养了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my father took him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此他就和我们住在一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's been with us ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是西西里人但我想他会当军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a Sicilian, but I think he's gonna be consigliere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 那是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - That's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.03,0:14:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是个顾问在家族中的地位非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a counselor, an advisor. Very important to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的扁形通心面还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like your lasagna?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在令媛的婚礼受到邀请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am honored and grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,深感荣幸与感激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have invited me to your daughter's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.13,0:15:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在令媛结婚的当天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the day of your daughter's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他们能早生贵子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hope that their first child be a masculine child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我一点小小的心意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pledge my ever-ending loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝福他们俩白头偕老 谢谢你 路卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your daughter's bridal purse. Thank you, Luca,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最珍贵的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my most valued friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下 我晓得你忙 我先告退了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone, I'm gonna leave you now because I know you are busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signora Corleone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,科利参议员对不能亲自来致歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Cauly apologized for not coming personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你会谅解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but said you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些法官也一样 他们都送了礼物敬你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also some of the judges.They've all sent gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. Hey, Johnny, look over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.49,0:18:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大老远由加州赶来参加婚礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came all the way from California to come to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你他会来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you he was going to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经两年了 - 他也许又有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's been two years. - He's probably in trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好教子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good godson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼…唱首歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你从未告诉我你认得强尼方亭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, you never told me you knew Johnny Fontane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想见他吗？- 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. You wanna meet him? - Huh? Oh, well, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,家父帮他建立他的事业 真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father helped him with his career.He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.91,0:19:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们先听这首唱 - 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's listen to the song. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 麦克 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Michael. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:20:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼刚出道时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Johnny was first starting out…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个乐队领班签了合约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was signed to this personal service contract with a big bandleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他走红后 想要解除合约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as his career got better and better he wanted to get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼是家父的教子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Johnny is my father's godson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是家父去见乐队负责人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my father went to see this bandleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且出一万元要他与强尼解约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he offered him $ 10, 000 to let Johnny go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the bandleader said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天家父再去见他 只是这次带着路卡布拉西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the next day my father went to see him only this time with Luca Brasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小时之内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And within an hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他签了解约书 只收了一千元的支票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he signed a release for a certified check of $ 1, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么办到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,家父提了个他不能拒绝的条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father made him an offer he couldn't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,路卡布拉西用枪顶着他的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luca Brasi held a gun to his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是不签字脑袋就会开花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my father assured him that either his brains or his signature would be on the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真实的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a true story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯 那是我的家庭 不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my family, Kay. It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会处理的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆叫山提诺来我的办公室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to find Santino. Tell him to come to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, Fredo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.83,0:22:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,家兄弗雷多 这位是凯亚当斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother Fredo. This is Kay Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - How ya doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.83,0:22:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是舍弟麦克 - 玩的愉快吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is my brother Mike. - Are you having a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. This is your friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.03,0:22:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的嗓子很虚弱 很虚弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My voice is weak.It's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之我若能得到那部戏的角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, if I had this part in the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再次走红的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it puts me right back up on top again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.01,0:22:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是电影公司的老板不让我演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this this man out there, he won't give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.30,0:22:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他叫什么名字？- 华尔斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The head of the studio. - What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.73,0:23:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯让我演而且还说门都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woltz. He won't give it to me and he says there's no chance, no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.35,0:23:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼？山尼？山尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼？你在里面吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.71,0:23:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老头子要见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.70,0:23:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 马上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.68,0:23:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月以前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A month ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.04,0:23:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他买下这本畅销书的电影版权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he bought the movie rights to this book.A best-seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.98,0:23:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,男主角就像是我的写照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the main character is a guy just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不需要演 只要当我自己即可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, I wouldn't even have to act.Just be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 教父 我不知该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Godfather, I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要表现得像个男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can act like a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.53,0:24:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.79,0:24:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你在好莱坞学到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how you turned out?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.05,0:24:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭的像个女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Hollywood finocchio that cries like a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.56,0:24:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办？怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What can I do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.17,0:24:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,算什么鬼话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.91,0:24:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂有此理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.12,0:24:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有花时间与家人共聚吗？- 我当然有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You spend time with your family? - Sure I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.37,0:24:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.11,0:24:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不抽空陪家人的男人 不是真正的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the man who doesn't spend time with his family can never be a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.49,0:24:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.53,0:24:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看来糟透了 我要你多吃点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look terrible. I want you to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to rest well, and a month from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.00,0:24:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起一个月内好莱坞大亨 会让你愿望成真{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this Hollywood big shot's gonna give you what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了他们一周内就要开拍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late. They start shooting in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.60,0:24:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给他一个他无法拒绝的提议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make him an offer he can't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.42,0:24:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你到外面去好好的玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now just go outside, enjoy yourself and forget about all this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.71,0:25:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它的交给我来办 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I want you to leave it all to me.All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.95,0:25:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿女婿何时离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time does my daughter leave with the bridegroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.94,0:25:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,切完蛋糕后的几分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few minutes, right after they cut the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.33,0:25:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新女婿要给重要职务吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, your new son-in-law, we give him something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never. Give him a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.27,0:25:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们过好日子 但别让他插手家族中的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but never discuss the family business with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.48,0:25:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.48,0:25:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔斯索拉索来过电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgil Sollozzo called.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.22,0:25:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周我们必须安排跟他见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to give him a day sometime next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.17,0:25:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你从加州回来我们再讨论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll discuss him when you come back from California.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:25:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何时要去加州了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When am I going to California?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.95,0:25:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你今晚去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.77,0:25:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你和这个电影大亨谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to talk to this movie big shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.86,0:25:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把强尼的事摆平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and settle this business for Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.98,0:26:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,若没有其它事 我想去参加我女儿的婚礼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's nothing else, I'd like to go to my daughter's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.40,0:26:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛 我们要拍照了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlo, we're gonna take the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.36,0:26:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.36,0:26:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 麦克 我不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Michael, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 就是这样 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little closer.Okay, that's it. Just like that now. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.85,0:28:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.59,0:28:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是强尼方亭的朋友派来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sent by a friend of Johnny Fontane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.84,0:28:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的朋友是我的委托人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This friend is my client and would give his undying friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.36,0:28:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是华尔斯先生能帮他个小忙 他将会感激不尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Mr. Woltz if Mr. Woltz would grant us a small favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.57,0:28:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woltz is listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.96,0:28:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你下周开拍的新片男主角 让强尼担任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Johnny the part in that new war film you're starting next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.68,0:28:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的朋友会回报我什么好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what favor would your friend grant Mr. Woltz?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.98,0:28:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若有工会问题我的委托人能摆平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have some union problems.My client could make them disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.45,0:28:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你旗下一位抽大麻的大牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, one of your top stars has just moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.20,0:28:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在吸起海洛因了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from marijuana to heroin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.19,0:28:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要威胁我吗？- 绝对没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you trying to muscle me? - Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.63,0:28:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.49,0:28:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着你这个油腔滑调的王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, you smooth-talking son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.18,0:28:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我对你及你的老板说清楚 不管他是何许人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me lay it on the line for you and your boss, whoever he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.53,0:29:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼方亭绝对得不到那个角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Fontane will never get that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.87,0:29:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎有多少意大利的移民 来找我麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care how many dago, guinea, wop greaseball goombahs come outta the woodwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是德裔爱尔兰人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm German-Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.73,0:29:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白告诉你 德国朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me tell you something, my kraut mick friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.38,0:29:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大祸临头了 你甚至不会晓得是谁扁你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make so much trouble for you, you won't know what hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.77,0:29:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔斯先生 我是位律师 我不是来威胁你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a lawyer. I have not threatened-
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.94,0:29:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识纽约的每位大律师 你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know almost every big lawyer in New York. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的执业情况特别 只为一位委托人办事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a special practice. I handle one client.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.02,0:29:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我的电话号码 我等你电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you have my number. I'll wait for your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.63,0:29:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 我很喜欢你的电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I admire your pictures very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.44,0:29:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸清他的底细{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.45,0:29:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是美极了 - 看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is really beautiful. - Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.98,0:30:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个原本是用来装饰王宫的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to decorate the palace of a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.23,0:30:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.79,0:30:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不说你为柯里昂阁下做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you say you worked for Corleone, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.13,0:30:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你只是个市井流氓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were just some cheap, two-bit hustler.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.04,0:30:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是强尼派来勒索我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny was running in, trying to bluff me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.09,0:30:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非真的必要 否则我不想提起他的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like to use his name unless it's really necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.99,0:30:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的酒还好吗？- 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's your drink, Tom? - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.69,0:30:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这边来 让你看看真正漂亮的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me. I want to show you something really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.47,0:30:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼光应该不错吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do appreciate beauty, don't you, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.11,0:30:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 这匹马价值六十万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are. $600, 000 on four hooves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.93,0:30:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说俄国沙皇 也从未在马身上花那么大笔钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet Russian czars never paid that kind of dough for a single horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.28,0:30:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,达通 达通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Khartoum.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.19,0:30:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我不会用它们来比赛 我要它们当种马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna race him, though. I'm gonna put him out to stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.31,0:30:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 汤尼 - 不必客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, Tony. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.87,0:30:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 - 我们去吃点东西吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Let's get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.60,0:30:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂是强尼的教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Corleone is Johnny's godfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.08,0:30:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对意大利人而言 那是种宗教上神圣的亲密关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Italian people, that's a very religious sacred, close relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.63,0:30:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很敬重这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.89,0:30:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他除了这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell him he should ask me anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.54,0:31:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都答应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one favor I can't give him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.89,0:31:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被拒绝一次后 不会再要求第二次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never asks a second favor when he's been refused the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.36,0:31:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 了解？- 你不了解 强尼方亭永远别想演那部电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understood? - You don't understand.Johnny Fontane never gets that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.62,0:31:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很适合那个角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That part is perfect for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.31,0:31:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让他成为巨星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll make him a big star.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.40,0:31:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要让他走投无路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna run him out of the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.88,0:31:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.56,0:31:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼毁了一位华尔斯国际公司 最有前途的女星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Fontane ruined one of Woltz International's most valuable proteges.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年来我们不断地训练她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For five years, we had her under training.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.54,0:31:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌唱课 表演课 跳舞课{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Singing lessons, acting lessons, dancing lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.76,0:31:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在她身上投资了无数的金钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent hundreds of thousands of dollars on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.97,0:31:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让她成为一位巨星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna make her a big star.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.49,0:31:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我更坦白的告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me be even more frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.13,0:31:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你知道我不是铁石心肠 也不是势利眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to show you that I'm not a hard-hearted man that it's not all dollars and cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.49,0:31:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她年轻漂亮 天真无邪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was beautiful. She was young, she was innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.13,0:31:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有她就等于拥有全世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the greatest piece of ass I've ever had and I've had 'em all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.52,0:31:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后强尼方亭出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Johnny Fontane comes along.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.73,0:31:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着磁性的嗓音 加上意大利的魅力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his olive oil voice and guinea charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.94,0:32:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她拐走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she runs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.81,0:32:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑掉了使我非常难堪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She threw it all away just to make me look ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.02,0:32:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我这种地位的人无法忍受难堪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a man in my position can't afford to be made to look ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.36,0:32:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上给我滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you get the hell outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.79,0:32:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是那混球想对我动粗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if that goombah tries any rough stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.57,0:32:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他我不是乐队领班{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell him I ain't no bandleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听过那个故事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I heard that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.26,0:32:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的晚餐款待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for the dinner and a very pleasant evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.34,0:32:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能派车送我去机场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your car could take me to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.29,0:32:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂先生坚持 坏消息要立刻回报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Corleone is a man who insists on hearing bad news immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.53,0:34:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会太累吧？- 汤姆 我在飞机上睡过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not too tired, Tom? - No, I slept on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.66,0:34:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里有索拉索的资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the Sollozzo notes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.87,0:34:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,众人皆知 索拉索是土耳其人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Sollozzo is known as "The Turk."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.52,0:34:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该善于用刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's supposed to be very good with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.69,0:34:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有发生利益冲突时才会使用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only in matters of business with some sort of reasonable complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.24,0:34:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是做毒品生意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His business is narcotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.29,0:34:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在土耳其种罂粟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has fields in Turkey where they grow the poppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.06,0:34:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在西西里有工厂提炼成海洛因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in Sicily he has the plants to process them into heroin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.01,0:34:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要现金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he needs cash and he needs protection from the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.78,0:35:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及在毒品交易时 需要警方的保护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for which he gives a piece of the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.65,0:35:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法查出保护费价钱多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't find out how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.56,0:35:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在纽约是塔塔基利亚家族 在保护他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tattaglia family is behind him here in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.51,0:35:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定也想分占利益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, they have to be in it for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.52,0:35:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santino Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.95,0:35:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的犯罪前科呢？一次在意大利 一次在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his prison record?Two terms, one in Italy, one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.78,0:35:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是众所周知的大毒枭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's known as a top narcotics man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.59,0:35:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,山提诺 你认为呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santino, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.98,0:35:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,白粉可以赚大钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of money in that white powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.89,0:35:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赞成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom? I say, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.26,0:35:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒品比什么都好赚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's more money potential in narcotics than anything else we're looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.27,0:35:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们不加入 别人也会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get into it, somebody else will.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.09,0:35:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是五大家族之也许全部都会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one of the five families, maybe all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.30,0:35:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会用毒品赚到的钱 买通警方和政客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the money they earn they can buy more police and political power.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.82,0:35:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时就会赶上我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they come after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们掌握了工会及赌场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have the unions, we have the gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.78,0:35:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们却掌握未来最好的东西 毒品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're the best things to have, but narcotics is a thing of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.47,0:35:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们若不能分一杯羹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get a piece of that action.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.12,0:35:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会失去一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we risk everything we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.46,0:35:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是指现在而是在十年之内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, but ten years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.23,0:36:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的答案是什么呢？爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? What's your answer gonna be, Pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.00,0:36:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.82,0:36:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要有势力的友人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a man who has powerful friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.29,0:36:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一百万元的现金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a million dollars in cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.91,0:36:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你手中掌握的政客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need, Don Corleone, those politicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.51,0:36:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,三成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.54,0:36:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一年你就可进帐三四百万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first year, your end should be 3, 4 million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.53,0:36:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后还会增加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it would go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔塔基利亚家族 会得到什么好处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is the interest for the Tattaglia family?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.22,0:36:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的敬意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.60,0:36:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会从我那一份当中分给他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of the Tattaglias outta my share.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.03,0:36:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提供财务 政治和法律的保护 可以分到三成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I receive 30% for finance political influence and legal protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.76,0:37:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你想说的 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what you're telling me. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.93,0:37:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you come to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.37,0:37:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为何值得你这么慷慨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I deserve this generosity?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.80,0:37:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你能考虑投资一百万元现金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you consider a million dollars in cash just finance,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.14,0:37:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会向你敬礼 柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ti saluto, Don Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.07,0:37:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯见你是因为 我听说你是个正直的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said that I would see you because I heard that you were a serious man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.30,0:37:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我以礼相待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be treated with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.32,0:37:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我必须拒绝你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must say no to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.67,0:37:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll give you my reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.62,0:37:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我是有很多政界的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true, I have a lot of friends in politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.66,0:37:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若他们知道我在搞毒品生意 而不再是赌博时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they wouldn't be friendly very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.61,0:37:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就不再是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they knew my business was drugs instead of gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.30,0:37:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为赌博 只是些无伤大雅的事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which they regard as a harmless vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.94,0:37:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但毒品是败坏德性的生意 - 但是柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But drugs is a dirty business. - No, Don Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.08,0:37:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言一个人以何为生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make any difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.81,0:38:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有什么差别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a man does for a living, you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.03,0:38:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你这种生意…有一点危险性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your business is a little dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.29,0:38:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你还是担心安全的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're worried about security for your million.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.06,0:38:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔塔基利亚会做保证的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Tattaglias will guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.88,0:38:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说塔塔基利亚家族 会保证我们的投资…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tellin' me the Tattaglias guarantee our investment-
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.41,0:38:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.57,0:38:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我把孩子都给宠坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a sentimental weakness for my children and I spoil them, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.29,0:38:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说话非常没有分寸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They talk when they should listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.46,0:38:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总之{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.07,0:38:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,索拉索先生 我的决定还是不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signor Sollozzo, my "no" is final.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.33,0:38:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要恭喜你的生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wish to congratulate you on your new business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.47,0:38:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会很成功我祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'll do very well, and good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.94,0:38:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你的生意不会与我的冲突{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially since your interests don't conflict with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.23,0:38:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.55,0:39:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,山提诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santino.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.38,0:39:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.50,0:39:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.59,0:39:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你和女孩子胡搞之后 脑子退化了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your brain is going soft from all that comedy you're playing with that young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.32,0:39:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让外人知道你在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never tell anybody outside the family what you're thinking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.80,0:39:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.83,0:39:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 这是什么乱七八糟的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, what. What is this nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.60,0:39:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是强尼送的 他主演了那部新电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from Johnny. He's starring in that new film.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.47,0:39:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 把它拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.89,0:39:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放到那去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.72,0:39:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.06,0:39:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫路卡布拉西到这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell Luca Brasi to come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.49,0:39:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这索拉索有点担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little worried about this Sollozzo fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.92,0:40:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你弄清楚他在耍什么把戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to find out what he's got under his fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.83,0:40:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,到塔塔基利亚那边去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the Tattaglias.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.51,0:40:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们以为你与我们家族不融洽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make them think that you're not too happy with our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.16,0:40:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find out what you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.92,0:40:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买了东西给令堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got something for your mother and for Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.39,0:40:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有给弗雷多的领带 给汤姆的钢笔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a tie for Freddy and Tom Hagen got the Reynolds pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.48,0:40:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你圣诞节想要什么？- 我只要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want for Christmas? - Me? Oh, just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.52,0:41:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andiamo, Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.34,0:41:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫保利备车 我们要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Paulie to get the car. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.33,0:41:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.90,0:41:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开车 保利今早生病了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to get it myself. Paulie called in sick this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.71,0:41:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利是个好孩子 我不介意自己开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paulie's a good kid. I don't mind gettin' the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.28,0:41:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.21,0:42:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路卡 我是布诺塔塔基利亚 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Luca, I am Bruno Tattaglia. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.30,0:42:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,想喝杯威士忌吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotch?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.95,0:42:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,先暖和一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prewar.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.47,0:42:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.55,0:42:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.10,0:42:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.58,0:42:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和塔塔基利亚家族谈过了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.49,0:42:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们可以一起做些生意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.96,0:42:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要像你这么壮的人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.79,0:42:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你与柯里昂家族不和
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.73,0:42:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,想加入我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.50,0:42:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能得到什么好处
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.99,0:43:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,起薪五万元
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.19,0:43:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不坏
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.58,0:43:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.58,0:44:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆哈金 圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.32,0:44:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴遇见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad I run into you. I wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.27,0:44:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你聊聊 我没时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.75,0:44:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们拨点时间 军师 上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, make time, consigliere. Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.88,0:44:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你担心什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.00,0:44:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀你的话你早己死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted to kill you, you'd be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.09,0:44:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.59,0:44:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍候一下 弗雷多 我买点水果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo, I'm gonna buy some fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.97,0:44:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.70,0:44:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 我要买些水果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Merry Christmas.I want some fruit over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.79,0:45:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme three of them.No, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.27,0:45:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.60,0:46:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa.Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.42,0:46:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 我若是修女 你是否会更喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like me better if I were a nun.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.71,0:46:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像小说中的角色你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like in the story, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.54,0:46:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.66,0:46:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我是英格丽褒曼 你是否会更喜欢我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then would you like me better if I were Ingrid Bergman?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.70,0:46:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个想法不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.65,0:46:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.65,0:46:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你若是英格丽褒曼 我不会更喜欢你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I would not like you better if you were Ingrid Bergman.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.43,0:46:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克 - 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike - What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.38,0:46:54.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（维多柯里昂被谋杀）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.88,0:47:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面没说他是死是活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't say if he's dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.63,0:47:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山尼 我是麦克 - 麦克 你到哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sonny, Michael. - Michael, where you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.89,0:47:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事吧？我们还不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he all right? We don't know yet. There's all kinds of stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.88,0:47:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他伤的很重 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was hit bad, Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.97,0:47:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还在吗？- 是的 我在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you there? - Yeah, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.66,0:47:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到哪去了？我很担心 汤姆没说我打过电话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you been? I was worried. Didn't Tom tell you? I called.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.60,0:47:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 回家来 你应该在这陪妈妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Look, come home, kid. You should be with Mama, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.52,0:47:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.94,0:47:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.50,0:48:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.26,0:48:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 开门 我是克里曼沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go. Who is it? - Open up. It's Clemenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.47,0:48:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有你老头的消息了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more news about your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.43,0:48:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,街头谣传他已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word is out on the street he's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.38,0:48:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事？山尼 别激动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth. What's the matter with you?Jesus Christ! Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.21,0:48:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保利在哪？- 保利病了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where was Paulie? - Paulie was out sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.33,0:48:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他整个冬天都病了 - 他病了几次？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's been sick all winter. - How many times he been sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.50,0:48:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,病了三四次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only maybe three, four times.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.11,0:48:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多并不想另找保镳 马上接他来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked Freddy if he wants a different bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.96,0:48:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说不行 - 我不管他病的有多重 马上找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He said no. - Pick him up now.I don't care how sick he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.57,0:48:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他还在呼吸 我要你把他带到家父的房子去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's breathin', I want you to bring him to my father's house now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.57,0:48:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand? Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.13,0:48:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我派人到这边来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to send people here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.26,0:48:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just you and him. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.68,0:49:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会派几个人到家里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.I'm havin' a couple of our people come to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.90,0:49:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 山尼柯里昂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Santino Corleone?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.29,0:49:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是 - 汤姆哈金在我们手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - We have Tom hagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.58,0:49:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,约三小时后我们会释放他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In about three hours, he'll be released with our proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.05,0:49:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你做任何事之前 先听听他说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to everything he has to say before you do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.48,0:49:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,木己成舟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.09,0:49:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别发怒 好吗？山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't lose that famous temper of yours, huh, Sonny?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.17,0:49:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 我会等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.20,0:49:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老板死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boss is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.97,0:49:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在家族中是不喜欢动武{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not in the muscle end of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.54,0:49:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不想要你感到害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I don't want you to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.57,0:49:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你帮助柯里昂还有帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to help the Corleones and I want you to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.43,0:49:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,接了你约一小时后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got him outside his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.04,0:50:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们己在他办公室外干掉他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about an hour after we picked you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.42,0:50:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.25,0:50:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在全看你的了 让我与山尼和平解决一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now it's up to you to make the peace between me and Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.02,0:50:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼对我的主意很热衷 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny was hot for my deal, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.19,0:50:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你知道那么做是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you knew it was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.26,0:50:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼会不惜一切的来追杀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny will come after you with everything he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.48,0:50:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会是他的第一个反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be his first reaction, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.78,0:50:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要你去劝劝他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you gotta talk some sense into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.77,0:50:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔塔基利亚家族全力支持我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tattaglia family is behind me with all their people.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.24,0:50:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约其它的家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other New York families.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.13,0:50:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会不惜一切防止全面的战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will go along with anything that will prevent a full-scale war.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.51,0:50:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们面对现实吧 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.81,0:50:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都尊敬他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in all due respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.16,0:50:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但教父己今非昔比 愿他安息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Don, rest in peace, was slippin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.75,0:50:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年前我能对付他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten years ago, could I have gotten to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.57,0:50:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在他已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.70,0:50:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.00,0:51:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么能让他复生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing can bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.35,0:51:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你得和山尼谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you gotta talk to Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.60,0:51:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也得说服两个大头目泰西欧及肥克里曼沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta talk to the caporegimes, that Tessio, that fat Clemenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.20,0:51:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是笔好生意 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good business, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.72,0:51:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.07,0:51:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但即使是山尼也阻止不了路卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even Sonny won't be able to call off Luca Brasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.58,0:51:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…路卡让我来担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well-Let me worry about Luca.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.86,0:51:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只管说服山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just talk to Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.34,0:51:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,及他另外两个兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other two kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.29,0:51:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力而为 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.24,0:51:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…你可以走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.66,0:52:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢暴力 汤姆 我是个生意人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like violence, Tom. I'm a businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.27,0:52:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,流血代价太高了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood is a big expense.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.11,0:52:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.06,0:52:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打了他五枪 他还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hit him with five shots, and he's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.15,0:52:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对我是件坏事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's bad luck for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.92,0:52:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不能谈成那档事 对你也不是好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bad luck for you if you don't make that deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.51,0:53:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,令堂在医院陪令尊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother's over in the hospital with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.68,0:53:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他能度遇难关 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he's gonna pull through, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.37,0:53:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全是塔塔基利亚家族策划的 - 你认为如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a lot of bad blood. - What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.53,0:53:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父认为这是设计好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too far. I think it's too personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.88,0:53:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把那些人全杀掉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna kill all those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.11,0:53:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别插手这件事 麦克 - 索拉索是关键 除掉他一切就好办了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay out of it, Mickey. - Sollozzo's the key. You get rid of him, everything falls into line.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.00,0:53:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,路卡呢？索拉索认为他可以控制路卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Luca? Sollozzo didn't seem worried about Luca.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.61,0:53:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.43,0:53:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果路卡出卖我们 我们就有大麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Luca sold out, we're in a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.13,0:53:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人能与路卡连络上吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone been able to get in touch with Luca?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.13,0:53:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试了一整夜但没有人接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been tryin' all night. He might be shacked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.03,0:53:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 帮我个忙打电话给路卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick, try him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.07,0:54:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从不在外留宿 他每次办完事会立刻回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luca never sleeps over with a broad.He always goes home when he's through.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.07,0:54:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 你是军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Tom, you're consigliere.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.45,0:54:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是老头死了我们该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do if the old man dies, God forbid?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.49,0:54:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们万一失去了老头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we lose the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.70,0:54:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会失去政界的联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we lose our political contacts and half our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.84,0:54:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约其它的家族 为了避免长期的战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other New York families might wind up supporting Sollozzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.61,0:54:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会联合支持索拉索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to avoid a long destructive war.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.36,0:54:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是一九四六年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is almost 1946.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.83,0:54:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人想再流血了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants bloodshed anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.08,0:54:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是令尊死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your father dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.12,0:54:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就由你做决定了 山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll make the deal, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.99,0:54:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说来容易 那不是你父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's easy for you to say. He's not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.68,0:54:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与你跟麦克 对他来说都是儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was as much a son to him as you or Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.54,0:54:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.19,0:54:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 我叫你在外面守着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Paulie, I thought I told you to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.35,0:54:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门的人说收到一包东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy at the gates, they say they got a package.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.97,0:54:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰西欧 去看看是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Tessio, go see what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.09,0:54:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我留在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to hang around?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.26,0:54:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 留在这 - 你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, hang around.- You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.39,0:54:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.52,0:54:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点吃的 你饿了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? There's some food in the icebox. You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.47,0:54:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没关系的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's all right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.73,0:55:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喝杯酒吧 - 一点白兰地能让你舒服点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How 'bout a little brandy?- That's good to sweat it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.50,0:55:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 去吧 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.77,0:55:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.59,0:55:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你立刻处置那个王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to take care of that son of a bitch right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.89,0:55:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利出卖了老头 那个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paulie sold out the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.59,0:55:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再见到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.84,0:55:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第一件先要解决的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that first thing on your list.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.92,0:55:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？- 明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understand? - Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.44,0:55:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 明天你带几个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mickey, tomorrow you get a couple of guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.39,0:55:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,到路卡的公寓去看看 等他出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Luca's apartment. Wait for him to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.36,0:55:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们不该让麦克太直接涉入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we shouldn't get Mike mixed up in this too directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.14,0:55:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说…待在家里接电话 那会有大帮助的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, hang around the house on the phone. It'll be a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.42,0:55:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,再试着打给路卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try Luca again. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.59,0:55:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 那是西西里人的口信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is this? - It's a Sicilian message.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.32,0:55:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那表示路卡布拉西与鱼同眠了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means Luca Brasi sleeps with the fishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.91,0:56:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在要走了 - 你今晚几点会回家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm goin' now. - What time you gonna be home?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.25,0:56:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许会很晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Probably late.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.38,0:56:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别忘了油饼 - 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't forget the cannoli. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.20,0:56:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗可 坐到另一边去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocco, sit on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.85,0:56:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挡住后照镜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You block the rearview mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.01,0:56:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始大发雷霆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny's runnin' wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.80,0:56:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要跟对手开战了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's thinkin' of goin' to the mattresses already.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.66,0:56:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在西区找个地方藏匿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find a spot over on the West Side.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.48,0:56:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试试西四三街三零九号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll try 309 West 43rd Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.74,0:56:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道西区有何好地方吗？我想想看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know any good spots on the West Side?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.39,0:56:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我会想的 - 你开车的时候想想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I'll think about it. - Think while you're drivin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.91,0:56:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个月要找一天到纽约去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna hit New York sometime this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.12,0:56:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒车出去时留意小孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And watch out for the kids when you're backin' out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.80,0:56:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 我要你到三九街去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paulie, I want you to go down 39th Street. Colosanto's.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.23,0:56:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去买十八个垫子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up 18 mattresses for the guys to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.35,0:56:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把账单拿给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.05,0:56:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 确定要干净的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, all right. - Make sure they're clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.70,0:57:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们要在那待段长时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys are gonna be stuck up in there for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.26,0:57:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是干净的 他们说消毒过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're clean. They told me they exterminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.65,0:57:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,消毒 用那个字很不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Exterminate"? That's a bad word to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.65,0:57:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,消毒 听听这个家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exterminate. Get this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.18,0:57:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 我们才不会为你消毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how we don't exterminate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.08,0:57:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那真是好笑 - 嘿 保利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Youse funny, or what? - Hey, Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.42,0:57:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,停到路旁去好吗？我要小便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over.I gotta take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.97,0:58:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.79,0:58:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把油饼给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the cannoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.69,0:58:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克…麦克…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.66,0:58:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.67,0:58:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wanted on the telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.98,0:58:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？- 女孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is it? - It's some girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.52,0:58:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 凯 令尊还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Kay?How's your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.00,0:58:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很好 他会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good. He's gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.70,0:58:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.74,0:58:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.34,0:58:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克 - 是 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michael? - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.86,0:58:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.68,0:58:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.98,0:58:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能说吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.97,0:59:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll see you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.80,0:59:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你为何不说你爱她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell that nice girl you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.89,0:59:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全心全意的爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you with all o' my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.79,0:59:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若不快点见到你 我会死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't see you again a-soon, I'm-a gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.57,0:59:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这来 孩子 学点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come over here, kid. Learn somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.43,0:59:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天你也许得 为二十个男人煮饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have to cook for 20 guys someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.64,0:59:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始先倒点油 炸大蒜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? You start out with a little bit of oil.Then you fry some garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.43,0:59:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后放西红柿 炒一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you throw in some tomatoes, some tomato paste.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.77,0:59:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它黏锅底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fry it. You make sure it doesn't stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.90,0:59:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,煮开了之后 加入香肠及肉丸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you got it to a boil, shove in all your sausage and meatballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.02,0:59:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加一点点酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a little bit of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.40,0:59:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及…一点点糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a little bit of sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.87,0:59:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的秘方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's my trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.09,0:59:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别说废话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you cut the crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.35,0:59:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有更重要的事要让你去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got more important things for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.39,0:59:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.48,0:59:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 你再也见不到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't see him no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.77,0:59:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.08,0:59:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到城里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.34,0:59:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,派保镖跟他一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send some bodyguards with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.51,0:59:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是去医院看爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to see Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.16,0:59:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管 派人跟他一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send somebody with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.43,1:00:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事的 索拉索知道他是「平民」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be all right. Sollozzo knows he's a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.24,1:00:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心点 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Be careful, huh? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.80,1:00:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是派人跟他一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send somebody with him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.62,1:00:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 我能与你一起去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.Can I go with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.97,1:00:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 凯 那里有刑警还有记者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Kay. There's gonna be detectives there.People from the press.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.75,1:00:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在车上等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ride in a cab.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.17,1:00:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要你卷入这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.60,1:00:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何时能再见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will I see you again?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.06,1:01:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,回新罕布什尔去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to New Hampshire.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.32,1:01:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打电话去你父母家找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll call you at your parents' house.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.06,1:01:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何时才能再见到你？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will I see you again, Michael?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.92,1:01:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.78,1:03:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.34,1:03:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是探病时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not supposed to be here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.68,1:03:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.90,1:03:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是家父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.55,1:03:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没人 守卫到哪去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody here. What happened to the guards?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.15,1:03:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,令尊访客太多妨碍了医院的作业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father just had too many visitors.They interfered with hospital service.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.31,1:03:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察在十分钟前要他们离去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police made them leave about ten minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.26,1:03:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请帮我接长滩四五六二零{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me Long Beach 4-5-6-2-0, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.77,1:03:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,护士等一下 先别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse, wait a minute. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.07,1:04:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼 我是麦克 我在医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, Michael. I'm at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.37,1:04:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很晚才到这儿 这没有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I got here late. There's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.02,1:04:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰西欧的人不在 也没有刑警 没有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody. No Tessio's men, no detectives, nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.27,1:04:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸单独一个人在这 - 不要惊慌 我们马上过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pop is all alone. - Don't panic. We'll send somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.58,1:04:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会惊慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.44,1:04:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但你必须离去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but you will have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.95,1:04:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我把家父移去另一间房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are gonna move my father to another room.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.73,1:04:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你是否能把这个拆开 我来推病床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you disconnect those tubes so we can move the bed out?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.94,1:04:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是不可能的 - 你认识家父吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's out of the question. - Do you know my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.41,1:04:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会来杀了他 懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men are coming here to kill him.You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.98,1:04:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请你帮我忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, help me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.82,1:05:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我是安索 那个糕饼师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I am Enzo, the baker.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.64,1:06:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还记得我吧？- 安索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You remember me? - Enzo?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.94,1:06:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是安索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Enzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.03,1:06:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好离开这 安索 这里会有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better get out of here, Enzo.There's gonna be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.02,1:06:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是有麻烦 我留在这帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is trouble, I stay here to help you-
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.54,1:06:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了令尊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.05,1:06:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.92,1:06:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在医院大门外面等我 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for me outside, in front of the hospital.All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.83,1:06:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上出来 快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be out in a minute. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.61,1:06:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.81,1:06:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息吧 爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lie here, Pop.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.24,1:06:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照料你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.41,1:06:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.13,1:07:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个丢掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.52,1:07:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.34,1:07:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手放在口袋里就像你有把枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hand in your pocket like you have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.12,1:07:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.72,1:07:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.13,1:08:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.32,1:09:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为把你们这些混混全关住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I got all you guinea hoods locked up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.24,1:09:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.54,1:09:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,守家父的人是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the men who were guarding my father, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.75,1:09:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小混蛋 竟敢管我的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you little punk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.22,1:09:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把那些人全赶走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled them guys off of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.35,1:09:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上离开这医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get out of here and stay away from this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.39,1:09:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你派人守护家父 否则我不会走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not moving until you put some guards around my father's room.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.04,1:09:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔 把他带回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phil, take him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.95,1:09:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子是清白的 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid's clean, Captain. He's a war hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.60,1:09:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个服役荣归的英雄 从未和黑手党混在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never been busted.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.68,1:09:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 我说把他带回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, I said take him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.63,1:09:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,索拉索付你多少钱来陷害家父？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the Turk paying you to set up my father, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.27,1:09:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他抓牢 让他站稳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take ahold of him. Stand him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.72,1:10:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是柯里昂家的律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the attorney for the Corleone family.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.85,1:10:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是私家侦探 雇来保护维多柯里昂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men are private detectives hired to protect Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.45,1:10:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有携带武器的执照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're licensed to carry firearms.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.88,1:10:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是你干预 我们明早法庭见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you interfere, you'll have to appear before a judge in the morning and show cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.53,1:10:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让他走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.09,1:10:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.96,1:10:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些新面孔是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with all the new faces?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.00,1:10:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在需要他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna need 'em now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.91,1:10:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过医院的事之后 山尼气疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the hospital thing, Sonny got mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.99,1:11:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晨四点干掉了 布诺塔塔基利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hit Bruno Tattaglia at 4:00 this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.07,1:11:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.01,1:11:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里看起来像是座城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a fortress around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.83,1:11:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,街上一天二十四小时 都有一百个枪手在巡逻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred button men on the street, 24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.86,1:11:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那土耳其人敢露出一根汗毛 就挂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Turk shows one hair on his ass, he's dead. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.69,1:11:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 到这里来 让我看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Michael, come here. Let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.73,1:11:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你漂亮极了 漂亮极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look beautiful. Just beautiful. You're gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.94,1:11:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.15,1:11:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那土耳其人想谈判{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Turk, he wants to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.85,1:11:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那王八蛋紧张了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine the nerve on this son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.62,1:11:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚整我们 今天想和谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Craps out last night, he wants a meeting today.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.92,1:11:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么说？- 他怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd he say? - What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.23,1:11:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我们派麦克去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to send Michael to hear the proposition.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.22,1:11:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,并保证那条件好到我们不会拒绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the promise is that the deal is so good that we can't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.83,1:11:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那布诺塔塔基利亚呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Bruno Tattaglia?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.42,1:11:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是条件的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.99,1:12:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他作为对家父挨枪的补偿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruno cancels out what they did to my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.15,1:12:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼 我们该听听他们怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, we ought to hear what they have to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.08,1:12:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…不再听了 军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more. Not this time, Consigliere.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.68,1:12:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再和谈 不再讨论 不再上索拉索的当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more meetings, no discussions, no more Sollozzo tricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.29,1:12:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去跟他们说 我要索拉索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give them one message, I want Sollozzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.32,1:12:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们就开战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, it's all-out war. We go to the mattresses.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.41,1:12:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼 其它家族不会支持的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the other families won't sit still for a war.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.66,1:12:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫他们把索拉索交给我 - 山尼 令尊不会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then they hand me Sollozzo. - Your father wouldn't like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.41,1:12:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是生意 不能感情用事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is business, not personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.14,1:12:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我父亲就该挨枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.31,1:12:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是令尊挨枪也是生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even shooting your father was business,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.83,1:12:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是个人的事 山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not personal, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.17,1:12:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那生意必须要停 行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then business will have to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.12,1:12:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 帮我个忙 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do me a favor, Tom-
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.60,1:12:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再建议我如何让事情过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more advice on how to patch things up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.03,1:12:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要帮我赢 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just help me win, please. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.42,1:12:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查出了打断麦克下巴 那麦克劳斯基队长的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out about this McCluskey who broke Mike's jaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.06,1:12:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.36,1:12:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定在索拉索的规费名单中 而且是很大一笔钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's definitely on Sollozzo's payroll, and for big money.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.79,1:12:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克劳斯基是索拉索的保镖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}McCluskey has agreed to be the Turk's bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.75,1:12:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要了解 山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have to understand, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.79,1:12:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当索拉索跟警察队长勾搭上时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that while Sollozzo's being guarded like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.01,1:12:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人可以碰他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is invulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.56,1:12:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去从没人胆敢干掉纽约警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody has ever gunned down a New York police captain. Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.34,1:12:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会是个大灾难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be disastrous.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.60,1:13:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有五大家族都会追杀你山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the five families would come after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.51,1:13:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族会被孤立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Corleone family would be outcast.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.37,1:13:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是老头的政治保护都会消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the old man's political protection would run for cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.54,1:13:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.85,1:13:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别轻举妄动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this into consideration.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.32,1:13:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.60,1:13:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.70,1:13:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.82,1:13:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管索拉索答应什么 他会杀了爸爸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what Sollozzo says about a deal.He's gonna kill Pop. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.86,1:13:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the key for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.77,1:13:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须干掉索拉索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to get Sollozzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.80,1:13:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike is right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.76,1:13:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个谈判就没有必要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something first.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.19,1:13:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个麦克劳斯基呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this McCluskey?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.92,1:13:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要拿这个条子怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do with this cop?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.88,1:13:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想与我开会 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to have a meeting with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.78,1:13:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会是我麦克 劳斯基及索拉索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be me McCluskey and Sollozzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.99,1:14:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来安排会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's set the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.24,1:14:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们查清楚会议地点在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get our informers to find out where it's going to be held.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.80,1:14:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须是公开场所 酒吧或餐厅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We insist it's a public place, a bar, a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.67,1:14:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,人多的地方对我比较安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace where there's people, so I feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.17,1:14:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与他们一见面 他们会搜身 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna search me when I first meet them, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.35,1:14:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我身上不能有武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can't have a weapon on me then.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.00,1:14:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,若克里曼沙能想出一个办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Clemenza can figure a way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.77,1:14:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能预先把武器放在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have a weapon planted there for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.94,1:14:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就能杀了他们两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'll kill them both.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.12,1:14:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么做？乖乖的大学生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do? Nice college boy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.04,1:14:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是不想和家族中的事 混在一块吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't want to get mixed up in the family business.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.52,1:15:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在因为他打了你 你就想干掉他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you want to gun down a police captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.72,1:15:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这里是什么？军队吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? 'Cause he slapped you in the face a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.94,1:15:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一英里以外开枪打他们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think this is the army, where you shoot them a mile away?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.21,1:15:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须离这么近 砰一声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get up close, like this and-
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.07,1:15:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的脑浆会溅到你身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blow their brains all over your nice Ivy League suit. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.11,1:15:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼… 你太感情用事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking this very personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.63,1:15:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 这是公事而他却感情用事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, this is business, and this man is taking it very, very personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.10,1:15:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说不能杀条子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does it say you can't kill a cop?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.92,1:15:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 麦克 - 汤姆 慢着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Mikey. - Tom, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.83,1:15:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个跟毒品买卖有关的条子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about a cop that's mixed up in drugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.61,1:15:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个不诚实的条子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about a dishonest cop, a crooked cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.77,1:15:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,和毒贩混在一起终于得到报应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who got mixed up in the rackets and got what was coming to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.26,1:15:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个好极了的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a terrific story.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.04,1:15:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,报社不是有我们的人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have newspaper people on the payroll, don't we, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.25,1:15:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也许对那故事有兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might like a story like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.42,1:15:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也许 只是也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might. They just might.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.66,1:15:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是感情用事 山尼 纯粹是公事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not personal, Sonny. It's strictly business.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.36,1:15:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过表面处理了 追踪不到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as cold as they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.13,1:15:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible to trace, so you don't worry about prints, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.65,1:15:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在扳机和手把上贴了特殊胶布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put a special tape on the trigger and the butt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.43,1:16:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 试试看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.06,1:16:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？扳机太紧了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, the trigger too tight?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.53,1:16:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的耳朵好辛苦 - 我没安装消声器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My ears. - I left it noisy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.62,1:16:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样才能吓走旁观的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way it scares pain-in-the-ass innocent bystanders away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.65,1:16:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你杀了他们两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you shot them both.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.74,1:16:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来你怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.60,1:16:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下吃完我的晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, finish my dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.94,1:16:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kid. Don't fool around.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.60,1:16:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让你的手垂下 让枪滑掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let your hand drop to your side and let the gun slip out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.20,1:16:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都认为你还拿着枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody will still think you got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.37,1:16:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会瞪着你的脸 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be staring at your face, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.54,1:16:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以快步离开那地方但不要跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so walk out of the place real fast, but you don't run.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.71,1:16:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别直视任何人 但也不要看其它地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look nobody directly in the eye, but don't look away, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.06,1:16:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会怕的不敢瞪你 相信我 不必担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be scared stiff of you, believe me so don't worry about nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.82,1:16:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若可以全身而退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're gonna turn out all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.65,1:16:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以休个长假到哪里都可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take a long vacation, nobody knows where.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.17,1:16:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们会处理善后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna catch the hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.78,1:17:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为后果会有多糟 他妈的蛮糟的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad do you think it's gonna be? Pretty goddamn bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.77,1:17:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能所有的家族会联合对付我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably all the other families will line up against us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.68,1:17:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没关系的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.85,1:17:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,每五年或十年都会发生一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things gotta happen every five years or so.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.28,1:17:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,害群之马必须要除掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten years. Helps to get rid of the bad blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.93,1:17:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次到现在已有十年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been ten years since the last one.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.40,1:17:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要先发制人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta stop them at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.23,1:17:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像要在慕尼黑制止希特勒一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like they should have stopped Hitler at Munich.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.31,1:17:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们容忍了希特勒 麻烦就大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should have never let him get away with that.They was just asking for big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.22,1:17:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mike,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.79,1:17:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都以你为荣 你是个英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we was all proud of you being a hero and all.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.78,1:17:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.72,1:18:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何线索 什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Not a hint. Absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.11,1:18:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,索拉索的人也不知在哪里开会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Sollozzo's people don't know where the meeting will be held.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.44,1:18:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有多少时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time do we have?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.35,1:18:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时半以后 他们在达西路口接你上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an hour and a half, exactly an hour and a half.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.56,1:18:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派个人追踪他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could put a tail on them, see how it turns out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.00,1:18:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,索拉索会在街上乱转 甩掉我们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sollozzo'll lose our ass going around the block.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.56,1:18:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来找我们谈判的人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the negotiator?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.51,1:18:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那边和我的手下玩纸牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's over at my place playing pinochle with a couple of my men.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.37,1:18:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很高兴 我们在让他赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's happy. They're letting him win.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.54,1:18:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对麦克太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too much of a risk for Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.89,1:18:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼 也许我们该取消{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we ought to call it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.33,1:18:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要麦克平安回来 我们才会让那个人走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The negotiator keeps playing cards until Mike's back safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.18,1:18:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不干脆干掉车上的人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't he blast who's ever in the goddamn car?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.35,1:18:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了 他们会注意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too dangerous. They'll be looking for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.05,1:18:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,索拉索也许根本就不在车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sollozzo might not even be in the car, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.56,1:18:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.36,1:19:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗区的路易斯餐厅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis Restaurant in the Bronx.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.65,1:19:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可柯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it reliable?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.83,1:19:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克劳斯基的分局里有我的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my man in McCluskey's precinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.78,1:19:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长必须二十四小时待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A police captain's got to be on call 24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.60,1:19:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他八点到十点会去那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He signed out at that number between 8:00 and 10:00.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.73,1:19:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁知道那个地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody know this joint?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.07,1:19:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure. I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.38,1:19:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们太理想了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfect for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.86,1:19:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭餐厅 食物精美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small family place, good food.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.03,1:19:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,各吃各的 太理想了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone minds his business. It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.76,1:19:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 那儿有个旧式马桶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete, they got an old-fashioned toilet-
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.80,1:19:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道就是水箱有吊链的那种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the box and the chain thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.70,1:19:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许可把枪用胶带绑在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might be able to tape the gun behind it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.74,1:19:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 麦克 你去餐厅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Mike, you go to the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.08,1:20:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一面吃一面聊 别紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eat, you talk for a while, you relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.43,1:20:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以使对方轻松下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make them relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.03,1:20:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你站起来去上厕所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you get up and go take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.46,1:20:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得先征求对方同意再去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, better still, you ask for permission to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.42,1:20:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来时就开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you come back, you come out blasting.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.21,1:20:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别失误 对准头颅各开两枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't take any chances. Two shots in the head apiece.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.28,1:20:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要一个好手去藏枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen. I want somebody good, and I mean very good, to plant that gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.32,1:20:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望我弟弟出来时手无寸铁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want him coming out with just his dick in his hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.75,1:20:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪会在那的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun will be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.27,1:20:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车送他 事后再接他回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen. You drive him and you pick him up after the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.52,1:20:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们动身了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.73,1:20:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉过你 事成之后立刻丢枪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he tell you to drop the gun right away?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.89,1:20:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百万次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a million times.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.76,1:20:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,切记 朝每人头部角？一出厕所后就打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget, two shots apiece in the head as soon as you come out the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.40,1:20:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认为要多久我才能回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think it'll be before I can come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.83,1:20:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少得一年 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least a year, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.96,1:21:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会转告妈 你临走前不能去看她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'll square with Mom you not seeing her before you leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.25,1:21:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你女朋友的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll get a message to that girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.98,1:21:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.71,1:21:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.83,1:21:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你来了 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you came, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.14,1:21:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我们能把事情谈妥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we can straighten everything out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.87,1:22:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事太可怕了 我并不希望发生这种事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is terrible. It's not the way I wanted things to go at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.52,1:22:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该发生这种事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should have never happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.12,1:22:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在今晚解决一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to straighten everything out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.99,1:22:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望我爸烦心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want my father bothered anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.46,1:22:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,会解决的 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.64,1:22:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以我孩子之名发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear on my children he won't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.80,1:22:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过谈的时候 你得坦诚才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to keep an open mind when we talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.88,1:22:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不像令兄的坏脾气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're not a hothead like your brother Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.31,1:22:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直没办法和他谈正事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't talk business with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.40,1:22:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.13,1:22:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚的事我很抱歉 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about the other night, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.74,1:22:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得搜你的身 转过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta frisk you, so turn around, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.25,1:22:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪在椅子上 脸向我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your knees, facing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.55,1:22:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我干这行已经嫌老了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm getting too old for my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.50,1:22:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too grouchy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.79,1:22:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,受不了别人的激怒 你该明白吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stand the aggravation.You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.05,1:22:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没带家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.22,1:23:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到新泽西去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to Jersey?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.92,1:23:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.79,1:23:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮极了 路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Lou.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.69,1:24:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的意大利菜味道还可以吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the Italian food in this restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.85,1:24:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.16,1:24:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试这里的小牛肉 是本市最棒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the veal. It's the best in the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.33,1:24:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.28,1:24:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.24,1:25:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allright,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.23,1:25:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和麦克用意大利语交谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna speak Italian to Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.07,1:25:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.64,1:25:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对现在的形势很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.84,1:25:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当真这样想？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.54,1:25:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道发生在我和你父亲之间的争斗纯粹是生意
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.53,1:25:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的父亲一直抱有极大的尊敬
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.89,1:25:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你父亲的思路已经过时了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.43,1:25:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要知道一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.97,1:25:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我是一个重信义的人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.24,1:25:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要和我说这些 我全明白
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.24,1:25:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些你都知道了？！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.00,1:26:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 可以告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.09,1:26:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经向塔塔利亚家族求援了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.50,1:26:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我确信我们将能够达成一个协议
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.69,1:26:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要和平！让我们把所有的仇恨和不快抛到脑后吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.24,1:26:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我希望…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.20,1:26:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.24,1:26:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.34,1:26:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言最重要的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's most important to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.84,1:26:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个保证 不再伤害家父的性命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that I have a guarantee:No more attempts on my father's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.36,1:26:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我怎么保证？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What guarantees could I give you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.36,1:26:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是惊弓之鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the hunted one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.05,1:26:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也失手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed my chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.70,1:26:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太看重我了 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think too much of me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.38,1:27:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有那么精明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not that clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.04,1:27:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要的只是息战而己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want is a truce.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.77,1:27:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要上厕所 可以吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to the bathroom. Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.15,1:27:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去就去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta go, you gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.05,1:27:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搜过了 他没带家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I frisked him. He's clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.83,1:27:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去太久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take too long.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.47,1:27:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搜过好几千人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've frisked a thousand young punks.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.00,1:28:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好些了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.38,1:28:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.28,1:29:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我再讲明白些争斗持续下去对你们会很糟
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.77,1:29:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能错过达成联盟的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.13,1:29:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要收拾局面 得结束这样的敌对局面
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.18,1:30:05.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警方追捕警察杀手）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.48,1:30:08.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（本市黑道瓦解）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.59,1:30:19.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警察队长与毒贩勾结）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.34,1:30:43.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑社会头子巴西尼接受警方盘问）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.77,1:31:14.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑社会大火并）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.46,1:31:22.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑社会大亨维多柯里昂返家）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.71,1:32:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 转进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.88,1:32:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你接手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, you take over.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.06,1:32:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 爷爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.90,1:32:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 爸 他还不认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Pa. He doesn't know you yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.72,1:32:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙 念给爷爷听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are, big guy. Give it to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.62,1:32:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我祝你早日康复 爷爷 我希望能快点见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I hope you get well, Grandpa and I wish I would see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.10,1:33:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你的孙子 法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love, your grandson, Frank."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.26,1:33:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 到外面去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.52,1:33:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带到楼下去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Take 'em downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.07,1:33:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 卡洛 你也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, Carlo. You too.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.72,1:33:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.93,1:33:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要烤鸡吗？那是他最喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got chicken cacciatore for you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.23,1:33:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但他能吃多少呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how much can you eat?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.03,1:33:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？卡洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you, Carlo?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.07,1:33:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 去摆桌子吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and set the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.53,1:34:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从麦克劳斯基被杀后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since McCluskey's killing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.26,1:34:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方瓦解了我们多数业务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the police have been cracking down on most of our operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.43,1:34:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它的家族也是一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also the other families'.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.69,1:34:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been a lot of bad blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.47,1:34:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们攻击我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hit us,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.98,1:34:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们反击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we hit them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.72,1:34:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过我们报社中的联系 我们提供了不少内幕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through our contacts in the newspapers we've been able to put out a lot of material.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.10,1:34:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多麦克劳斯基 跟毒贩索拉索勾结的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about McCluskey being linked with Sollozzo in the drug rackets.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.61,1:34:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以风声已经没有那么紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, things are starting to loosen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.04,1:34:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我派弗雷多去拉斯维加斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm sending Fredo to Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.91,1:34:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在洛杉矶的弗朗西斯科阁下 会给予他保护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the protection of Don Francesco of L.A.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.70,1:34:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他休息一会儿 我要去学赌场的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him to rest. I'm going to learn the casino business.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.67,1:34:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Michael?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.52,1:35:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀索拉索的是麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Michael who killed Sollozzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.47,1:35:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他很安全 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.86,1:35:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把他弄回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're starting to work to bring him back now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.78,1:35:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查出塔塔基利亚 躲在哪儿没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to find out where that little pimp Tattaglia is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.86,1:35:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他的命 现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want his ass now, right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.30,1:35:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 山尼 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Sonny. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.00,1:35:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在局势才刚刚缓和下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are starting to loosen up a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.78,1:35:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若去追塔塔基利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you go after Tattaglia,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.33,1:35:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,又会引起一场大战的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all hell's going to break loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.59,1:35:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等事情平静一点让爸爸去协调{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the smoke clear. Pop can negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.29,1:35:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爸爸在身体好转之前 什么都不能做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Pop can't do nothing till he's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.06,1:35:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要决定什么对我们最有利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna decide-
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.07,1:35:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 可是你那场火并 使我们损失很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, but your war's costing us a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.07,1:35:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何进帐 我们不能做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's coming in. We can't do business.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.67,1:35:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也不行 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither can they. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.79,1:35:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没有我们损失那么大 - 请你别担心这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't afford a stalemate. - No more stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.66,1:36:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会以宰了那老混蛋来做结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna end it by killing that old bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.48,1:36:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你现在名声很大 你一定很得意吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting a great reputation. I hope you're enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.87,1:36:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,依照我叫你做的去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what I tell you to do!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.52,1:36:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 我若有个西西里人 来当我的战略军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, if I had a wartime consigliere, a Sicilian.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.60,1:36:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会落到这种地步了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be in this shape!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.52,1:36:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸有杰安可 看看我有什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop had Genco. Look what I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.69,1:36:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是有意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.20,1:36:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈煮了晚餐 今天是星期天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom made a little dinner. It's Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.11,1:36:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑人对我们哈林区的 银行新政策非常满意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niggers are having a good time with our policy banks up there in Harlem.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.63,1:36:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开着新凯迪拉克 我先帮他们付一半的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving them new Cadillacs, paying 50? on a bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.70,1:36:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他们开始赚钱时 我就知道这会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that was gonna happen as soon as they started making big money.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.01,1:36:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸从来不在餐桌上 当着孩子们谈他的公事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa never talked business at the table in front of the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.56,1:36:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 康妮… - 不准你叫她闭嘴 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, Connie. - Don't you ever tell her to shut up. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.08,1:36:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别干预{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santino, don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.68,1:36:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼 汤姆 吃过饭后 我想与你们谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, Tom, I'd like to talk to you, maybe after dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.41,1:36:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对家族也许能帮很多的… 我们不在餐桌上讨论公事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be doing more for the family. We don't discuss business at the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.60,1:37:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你致敬 汤玛西诺阁下
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.59,1:37:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.16,1:37:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何离房子那么远？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.71,1:37:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可知万一你出了事 我要向令尊负责的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.36,1:37:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,保镖们都在这
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.40,1:37:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是十分危险
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.83,1:38:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听纽约的山提诺说的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.36,1:38:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的敌人知道你在这了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.53,1:38:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,山提诺有没有说我何时能回去？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.78,1:38:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.60,1:38:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.86,1:38:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.42,1:38:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.20,1:38:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂村
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.67,1:38:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐我的车去
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.28,1:38:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想走路
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.79,1:38:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.59,1:38:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 柯里昂村到了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.74,1:39:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的男人都到哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.52,1:39:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全都在战争中死了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.61,1:39:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是死者的姓名
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.66,1:40:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天 好一个美女
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.81,1:40:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像中邪了一样
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.25,1:40:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.81,1:40:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在西西里 女人比猎枪还危险
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.76,1:40:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,打猎有收收获吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.94,1:40:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这一带所有的女孩吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.33,1:40:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看到几位真正的美人
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.97,1:41:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一位让我们的朋友触电了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.18,1:41:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可真够骚了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.61,1:41:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她全身上下都很美
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.41,1:41:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么漂亮的头发 嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.54,1:41:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一带的女孩都很美 而且很贞洁
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.28,1:41:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个穿着紫色衣服
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.01,1:41:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发上绑着紫色的缎带
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.79,1:41:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像希腊人而非意大利人
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.91,1:41:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.51,1:41:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.86,1:41:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在本镇没有那样子的女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.28,1:41:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.10,1:41:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对了？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.84,1:42:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.84,1:42:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.14,1:42:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他出来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.49,1:42:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,法布利奇欧 你翻译
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.26,1:42:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.83,1:42:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若冒犯了你 我道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize if I offended you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.00,1:42:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我初到贵地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a stranger in this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.04,1:42:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意冒犯你和令媛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I meant no disrespect to you or your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.76,1:42:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个美国人到 西西里来避风头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an American hiding in Sicily.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.24,1:42:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.45,1:43:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人会为了钱 而出卖我在此的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are people who would pay a lot of money for that information.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.69,1:43:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那样令媛会失去父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then your daughter would lose a father.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.17,1:43:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是得到一位丈夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of gaining a husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.77,1:43:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想认识你女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to meet your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.50,1:43:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要在你的同意下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your permission.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.71,1:43:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,及在你的家人的监督之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and under the supervision of your family.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.19,1:43:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对是诚心诚意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.86,1:43:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期天早上到我家来 我叫维提
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.47,1:43:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.30,1:43:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.33,1:43:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾波洛妮亚
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.94,1:43:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.47,1:44:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是小女 艾波洛妮亚
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.11,1:44:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是麦克柯里昂先生
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.43,1:45:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.48,1:46:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我回来干你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll knock you dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.11,1:46:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话少说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it for the library.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.97,1:47:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们得去接我妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We've got to pick up my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.60,1:47:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.81,1:47:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.28,1:47:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我的错 - 他在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was my fault! - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.85,1:47:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼 拜托 是我的错 我先打他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, please. It was my fault. I hit him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.75,1:47:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我先开始打他的 求你了 山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started a fight with him. Please, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.14,1:47:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先打他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.91,1:47:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是叫医生来看你 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna get a doctor to come and take a look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.86,1:47:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼 求你别动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, please don't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.56,1:47:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你是怎么了？我会怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you? What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.65,1:47:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你肚里的孩子 做遗腹子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I gonna make that baby an orphan before he's born?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.85,1:47:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.15,1:48:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙把洋基队打得惨兮兮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still betting the Yankees pretty heavy?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.36,1:48:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们不要再接受投注了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to stop taking action, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.79,1:48:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上周末输的钱够多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost enough money last weekend to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.04,1:48:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛 到这来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlo, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.65,1:49:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再碰我妹妹一下我会杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You touch my sister again, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.40,1:53:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你会来 凯 怎么不先打个电话来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't expecting you. You should call.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.73,1:53:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有打 我写过信也打过电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, I have. I've tried writing and calling.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.08,1:53:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和麦克联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I wanna reach Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.37,1:53:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道他在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.90,1:53:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道他没事但如此而己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know he's all right, but that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.15,1:53:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 那是件车祸但没有人受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - That's an accident. But nobody was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.93,1:53:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.36,1:53:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你把这封信交给麦克 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you give this letter to Michael, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.58,1:53:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若接受了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I accepted that in a court of.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.99,1:53:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,法院可以证实我晓得他在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}law they could prove I have knowledge of his whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.00,1:53:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有耐心点 凯 他会与你联络的 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be patient. He'll get in touch with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.52,1:53:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让我的出租车走了 我是否能进去打电话叫一辆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let my cab go. Can I come in to call another one?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.43,1:53:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 对不起 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'm sorry. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.31,1:54:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Carlo there?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.04,1:54:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是哪位？- 我是卡洛的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's this? - This is a friend of Carlo's.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.69,1:54:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他我今晚没空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you tell him that I can't make it tonight until later?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.72,1:54:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.11,1:54:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚餐在桌上了 - 我还不饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dinner's on the table. - I'm not hungry yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.80,1:54:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐在桌上快凉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your food is on the table. It's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.05,1:54:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有约了 - 你刚叫我给你做晚餐的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll eat out later. - You told me to make you dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.91,1:54:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开好吗？你才滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, vaffancolo, eh? I'll vaffanculo you!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.21,1:54:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个意大利婊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little guinea brat.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.03,1:54:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 全都打破了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Break it all,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.20,1:54:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这被宠坏的女娃 全打破了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you spoiled guinea brat. Break it all!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.57,1:55:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不把那个妓女 带回家吃晚饭？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you bring your whore home for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.87,1:55:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我会 有何不可？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I will. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.91,1:55:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在把它清干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.26,1:55:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要 我才不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hell I will!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.60,1:55:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,清干净 贱人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean it up, you guinea spoiled brat!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.98,1:55:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,清干净 我说清干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean it up! I said clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.24,1:55:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,清干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.89,1:55:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.15,1:55:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,清干净 他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.27,1:55:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,清干净…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.83,1:55:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,清干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.52,1:55:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 杀我 像你爸一样当凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now! Kill me! Be a murderer like your father!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.34,1:55:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 你们姓柯里昂的全是凶手 - 我恨你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All you Corleones are murderers! - I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.77,1:55:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 贱人 我要杀了你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.94,1:55:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 杀我 滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me! Get up! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.60,1:55:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我恨你 - 否则我要杀你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hate you! - Now I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.33,1:55:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这意大利贱货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guinea brat, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.16,1:56:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out here!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.66,1:56:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.30,1:56:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不见你说的 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear you. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.87,1:56:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮 说大声点 孩子在哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk louder. The baby's crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.95,1:56:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,山提诺 我听不懂 我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santino, I can't understand, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.11,1:56:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？康妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Connie.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.98,1:56:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你在那等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you wait there.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.32,1:56:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你在那等着就对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you just wait there.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.97,1:56:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.88,1:56:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.52,1:56:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开门 站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the goddamn gate. Get off your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.67,1:57:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.09,1:57:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.16,1:57:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.06,1:57:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他一起去 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go after him. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.53,1:57:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋 快点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch. Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.50,1:59:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.70,1:59:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太太在楼上哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife is crying upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.39,1:59:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见车子到家里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear cars coming to the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.52,1:59:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consigliere of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.77,2:00:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都知道只有我毫不知情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should tell your Don what everyone seems to know.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.33,2:00:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没告诉妈任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell Mama anything.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.67,2:00:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正预备去叫醒你 并告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to come up and wake you just now and tell you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.18,2:00:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你需要先喝杯酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you needed a drink first.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.21,2:00:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你喝过酒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you've had your drink.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.30,2:00:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在收费站杀了山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot Sonny on the causeway.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.55,2:00:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.82,2:00:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要追查此事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.42,2:00:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要复仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want no acts of vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.50,2:01:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你安排一次会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to arrange a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.37,2:01:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,与五大家族的族长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the heads of the five families.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.10,2:01:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场火并该终止了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This war stops now.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.93,2:01:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给包纳萨拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Bonasera.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.66,2:01:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在需要他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need him now.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.09,2:01:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是汤姆哈金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Tom Hagen calling for Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.56,2:01:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多柯里昂要我打这个电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at his request.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.21,2:01:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠教父一次人情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you owe your Don a service.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.81,2:02:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信你会回报他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has no doubt that you will repay it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.37,2:02:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在一小时后会到你的殡仪馆去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he will be at your funeral parlor in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.06,2:02:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请在那等待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be there to greet him.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.94,2:02:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.37,2:02:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你预备为我服务了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you ready to do me this service?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.85,2:02:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但你要我怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.23,2:02:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你尽你一切的力量和技巧 好好为他化妆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to use all your powers and all your skills.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.00,2:02:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要他母亲看到他这个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want his mother to see him this way.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.09,2:03:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们是怎么对我的孩子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how they massacred my boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.57,2:03:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,教你英文会安全一点
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.80,2:03:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会英文 星期一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monday, Tuesday, Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.55,2:03:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期二 星期三 星期四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wednesday, Friday, Sunday, Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.82,2:03:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期五 星期日 星期六 好极了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.14,2:04:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 汤玛西诺阁下
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.58,2:04:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克在教我开车
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.39,2:04:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开给你看
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.86,2:04:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里的一切都还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.55,2:04:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人不再尊重任何事了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.72,2:04:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,时代越变越糟
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.62,2:04:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方对你己变得太危险了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.10,2:04:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你搬到西拉古莎附近的别墅
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.86,2:04:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对了？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.60,2:04:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,由美国传来的坏消息
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.37,2:04:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥山尼 他们杀了他
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.26,2:05:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了 你答应的
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.45,2:05:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法布利奇欧 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fabrizio. - Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.01,2:05:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,备车
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.92,2:05:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要自己开吗？老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you driving yourself, boss?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.70,2:05:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.79,2:05:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太太跟你一起去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your wife coming with you?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.31,2:05:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要你送她回娘家 等一切安全点再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to her father's house till I know things are safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.90,2:05:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 随你吩咐 老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you say, boss.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.20,2:05:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗 艾波洛妮亚呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calo, where is Apollonia?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.81,2:05:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想给你个惊喜 她要开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She' going to surprise you. She wants to drive.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.58,2:05:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会当个好的美国太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll make a good Amrican wife.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.18,2:05:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我去拿行李{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I'll get the baggage.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.54,2:06:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,法布利奇欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fabrizio!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.97,2:06:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.59,2:06:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 在那等 我开过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael. Wait there! I'll drive to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.62,2:06:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 艾波洛妮亚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Apollonia!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.26,2:06:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴西尼阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Barzini, I want to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.45,2:06:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我安排这次会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for helping me organize this meeting here today.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.31,2:06:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有纽约和新泽西 其它五大家族的族长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also the other heads of the five families from New York and New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.99,2:07:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗区的卡麦克瑞安诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carmine Cuneo from the Bronx.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.03,2:07:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及…布鲁克林的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.14,2:07:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲立浦塔塔基利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip Tattaglia.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.71,2:07:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,由史坦登岛来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from Staten Island.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.88,2:07:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多史特基{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have with us Victor Strachi.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.21,2:07:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,及由加州堪萨斯来的同道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the other associates that came as far as from California and Kansas City.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.00,2:07:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及全国其它各地区所来的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the other territories of the country.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.73,2:07:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.68,2:07:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情怎么会演变成如此？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did things ever get so far?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.19,2:07:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不晓得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.80,2:07:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那么的不幸及那么的没必要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so unfortunate and so unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.47,2:07:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔塔基利亚失去了一个儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tattaglia lost a son.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.77,2:07:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I lost a son.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.28,2:07:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该停手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're quits,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.59,2:07:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是塔塔基利亚同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if Tattaglia agrees.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.82,2:08:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意让事情恢复以前的局面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'm willing to let things go on the way they were before.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.36,2:08:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很感谢柯里昂阁下 召开这次会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all grateful to Don Corleone for calling this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.05,2:08:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都了解他是个有信用的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know him as a man of his word.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.79,2:08:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为人谦虚 总是能讲道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A modest man. He'll always listen to reason.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.39,2:08:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 巴西尼阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Don Barzini.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.56,2:08:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太谦虚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's too modest.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.60,2:08:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的法官与政客 没有不听他指示的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had all the judges and politicians in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.98,2:08:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却拒绝与我们分享{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He refused to share them.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.85,2:08:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何时拒绝过与大家分享{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did I ever refuse an accommodation?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.76,2:08:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在座的全都认识我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you know me here.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.19,2:08:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一次以外 我何时拒绝过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did I ever refuse, except one time?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.32,2:08:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.96,2:08:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我相信毒品生意 在往后几年会毁了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I believe this drug business is gonna destroy us in the years to come.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.78,2:08:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不像赌 酒和女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like gambling or liquor or even women.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.12,2:08:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是人们想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is something that most people want nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.14,2:08:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是教会不准我们做而己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is forbidden to them by the pezzonovante of the church.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.15,2:08:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使警察过去在赌博等方面愿意协助我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the police departments that have helped us in the past with gambling and other things.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.97,2:09:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一提到毒品 他们会拒绝帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are gonna refuse to help us when it comes to narcotics.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.43,2:09:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前那么想 现在想法依然不变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believed that then and I believe that now.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.70,2:09:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,时代变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.82,2:09:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像昔日了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like the old days.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.08,2:09:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做任何我们想做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we could do anything we want.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.78,2:09:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拒绝合作实在不够朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A refusal is not the act of a friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.59,2:09:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下握有全纽约 法律界以及政客的势力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Don Corleone had all the judges and politicians in New York.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.67,2:09:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就必须与大家分享 让大家都能利用他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he must share them or let others use them.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.75,2:09:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须让我们分汲利益 大家一起发财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must let us draw the water from the well.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.79,2:09:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然他能因这种服务 而向大家收费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, he can present a bill for such services.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.48,2:09:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我们不是共产党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, we are not Communists.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.34,2:09:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同样的也不相信毒品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also don't believe in drugs.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.42,2:09:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来我付手下优厚的待遇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years, I paid my people extra.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.85,2:09:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,使他们不去沾毒品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they wouldn't do that kind of business.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.46,2:09:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免有人来找他们 并且说我有白粉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody comes to them and says, "I have powders.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.37,2:09:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要投资三千元到四千元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you put up a three, four-thousand-dollar investment.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.32,2:09:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以赚到五万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can make 50, 000 distributing."
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.01,2:09:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎能抗拒得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they can't resist.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.65,2:10:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想以正派的方法 来经营毒品生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to control it as a business to keep it respectable.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.43,2:10:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要它们接近学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it near schools.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.16,2:10:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要把它们卖给孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it sold to children.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.11,2:10:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是残害幼苗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an infamia.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.15,2:10:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想卖给那些黑人 或是在有色人种中流通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my city, we'll keep the traffic in the dark people, the colored.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.06,2:10:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们反正是动物 所以让他们去堕落吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're animals anyway, so let them lose their souls.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.05,2:10:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本希望能合理的讨论一些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hoped that we could come here and reason together.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.99,2:10:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为一个讲道理的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a reasonable man, I'm willing to do whatever's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.56,2:10:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意为此事找个和平解决之道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find a peaceful solution to these problems.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.20,2:10:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们全都达成协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we are agreed.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.63,2:10:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒品生意可以做但要有限制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The traffic in drugs will be permitted but controlled.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.67,2:10:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下会给我们东部的保护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone will give us protection in the east.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.70,2:10:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们和平相处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there will be the peace.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.36,2:10:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须有柯里昂阁下的 确切保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must have strict assurance from Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.14,2:10:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一他的地位越来越坚固之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As time goes by and his position becomes stronger.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.40,2:10:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是否会采取复仇行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will he attempt any individual vendetta?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.96,2:10:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着我们这全是讲理的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we are all reasonable men here.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.13,2:11:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需像是律师般 给什么确切保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to give assurances as if we were lawyers.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.60,2:11:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谈到复仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk about vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.25,2:11:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇会让你的儿子复活吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is vengeance gonna bring your son back to you?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.67,2:11:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我的儿子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or my boy to me?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.19,2:11:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再去计较我儿子的死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forego the vengeance of my son.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.83,2:11:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有个自私的要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have selfish reasons.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.47,2:11:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小儿子被迫离开这个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My youngest son was forced to leave this country.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.12,2:11:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都因为这索拉索的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of this Sollozzo business.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.03,2:11:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须安排让他安全的回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. And I have to make arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.02,2:11:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗脱种种无中生有的罪名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring him back here safely, cleared of all these false charges.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.10,2:11:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是个迷信的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm a superstitious man.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.40,2:11:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是他不幸发生意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if some unlucky accident should befall him.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.27,2:11:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或被警察开枪打死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he should get shot in the head by a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:49.08,2:11:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或在牢里上吊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if he should hang himself in his jail cell.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.82,2:11:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是他被闪电击中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of if he's struck by a bolt of lightening.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.85,2:12:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我会怪罪于在这房间内的诸位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'm going to blame some of the people in this room.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.20,2:12:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那时候我就不会再客气了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that I do not forgive.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.97,2:12:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但除了那个以外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that aside.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.39,2:12:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以我孙子的性命发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me say that I swear on the souls of my grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.69,2:12:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会是打破我们今天和议的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I will not be the one to break the peace we've made here today.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.42,2:12:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我见塔塔基利亚的人时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I meet with the Tattaglia people, should I insist.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.42,2:12:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,应否坚持那些毒品中间人 都没有前科？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all these drug middlemen have clean records?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.06,2:12:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,提出来无妨 不要坚持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mention it. Don't insist.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.23,2:13:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴西尼这种人你不说他也明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barzini is a man who'll know that without being told.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.13,2:13:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说塔塔基利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Tattaglia.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.92,2:13:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔塔基利亚是个下三滥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tattaglia's a pimp.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.82,2:13:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本没本事干掉山提诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never could've outfought Santino.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.52,2:13:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在今天以前并不晓得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't know until this day that it was.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.37,2:13:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直是巴西尼在主使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barzini all along.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.39,2:13:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 南希{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.68,2:13:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家紧跟在一起 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep together, everyone. Brian?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.60,2:13:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.57,2:13:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来多久了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been back?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.36,2:14:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been back a year.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.51,2:14:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还不只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longer than that, I think.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.33,2:14:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好 凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.72,2:14:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在为我父亲做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working for my father now.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.83,2:14:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他病了 病的很重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been sick.Very sick.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.35,2:14:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不像他 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not like him.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.38,2:14:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会成为令尊那样的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you weren't going to become a man like your father.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.99,2:14:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你所告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.06,2:14:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,家父与其它有权的人一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's no different than any other powerful man.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.54,2:14:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那种要对其他人负责任的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any man who's responsible for other people.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.05,2:14:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是参议员或是总统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a senator or a president.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.44,2:14:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你说这些话有多天真{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how naive you sound?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.14,2:14:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.31,2:14:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员及总统不杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senators and presidents don't have men killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:59.21,2:15:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁天真？凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's being naive?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.51,2:15:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,家父做事的那一套己过时了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's way of doing things is over.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.77,2:15:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,连他都晓得那一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's finished. Even he knows that.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.33,2:15:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说在五年之内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, in five years the Corleone family.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.63,2:15:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族会完全合法化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to be completely legitimate.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.18,2:15:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.27,2:15:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚我未来的走向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I can tell you about my business.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.61,2:15:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.82,2:15:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你为何到这来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.21,2:15:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.34,2:15:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟想要我怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with me after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.90,2:15:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年来 你不打电话也不写信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without even calling or writing?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.38,2:15:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这是因为我需要你 我关心你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here because I need you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.64,2:15:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别再说了 - 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because I care for you. - Please stop it.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.90,2:15:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我要你嫁给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I want you to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.41,2:15:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太迟了 - 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's too late. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.76,2:15:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.53,2:15:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会做任何事 以弥补过去所发生的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do anything you ask to make up for what's happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.52,2:15:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那很重要 凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's important.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.69,2:15:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what's important is that.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.25,2:15:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拥有彼此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have each other.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.03,2:15:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们要共度一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we have a life together.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.98,2:16:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we have children.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.67,2:16:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our children.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.33,2:16:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.49,2:16:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.19,2:16:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.14,2:16:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴西尼的人抢我们的地盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barzini's people chisel my territory.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.23,2:16:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们却无能为力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we do nothing about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.96,2:16:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过不久布鲁克林 我连落脚的地方都没有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, there won't be one place in Brooklyn I can hang my hat.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.83,2:16:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有耐性点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be patient.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.92,2:16:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是求你帮忙 只是不想受制肘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not askin' you for help. Just take off the handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.92,2:16:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,再忍耐点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.13,2:16:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须保护自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta protect ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.04,2:16:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个机会再培养一些新人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a chance to recruit some new men.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.08,2:16:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.86,2:16:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不要给巴西尼借口来开战 - 麦克 你错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't wanna give Barzini an excuse to start fighting.- Mike, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.11,2:16:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.28,2:17:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾说过要让我与泰西欧 自立门户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you once said the day would come when Tessio and me could form our own family.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.40,2:17:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天以前我想都不敢想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till today, I would never think of it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.40,2:17:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我要求你的批准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must ask your permission.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.56,2:17:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在由麦克当家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Michael is now head of the family and.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.63,2:17:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他答应我就祝福你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he gives his permission, then you have my blessing.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.74,2:17:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们搬到内华达州后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we make the move to Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.08,2:17:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可由柯里昂家族分出 自立门户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can break off from the Corleone family and go on your own.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:18.33,2:17:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得在我们搬到内华达州之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we make the move to Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.76,2:17:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那得花多少时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will that be?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.59,2:17:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.15,2:17:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Godfather,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.45,2:17:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当你走了后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with you gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.19,2:17:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与彼得迟早会成为巴西尼的靶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and Pete'll come under Barzini's thumb sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.49,2:17:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨那该死的巴西尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hate that goddamn Barzini.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.30,2:17:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月之后 我们已经搞不出什么玩意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In six months' time, there won't be nothing left to build on.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.13,2:17:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的判断有信心吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have faith in my judgment?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:38.30,2:17:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.42,2:17:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍对我忠心吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have your loyalty?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.55,2:17:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 忠心不二 教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always, Godfather.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:42.16,2:17:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就当麦克的朋友吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then be a friend to Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.42,2:17:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,照他所说的去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do as he says.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.33,2:17:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有些事仍在磋商{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things being negotiated that are gonna solve.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.93,2:17:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的问题和困难 全都可以得到解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all your problems and answer all your questions.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:55.67,2:17:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我只能这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I can tell you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.92,2:18:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛 你在内华达长大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlo, you grew up in Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.43,2:18:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们搬的时候 你会是我的左右手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we make our move there, you're gonna be my right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.95,2:18:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆哈金不再做军师了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Hagen's no longer consigliere.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:07.38,2:18:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将会担任 我们在拉斯维加斯的律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be our lawyer in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.99,2:18:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对汤姆没有不满 但我不要他再当军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no reflection on Tom, but that's the way I want it.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:12.54,2:18:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且有我父亲在 他可以做我最佳的军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, if I ever need help who's a better consigliere than my father?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.66,2:18:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.38,2:18:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 爸爸 - 我为你高兴 卡洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Papa. - I'm happy for you, Carlo.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.33,2:18:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 我为何出局了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I out?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.45,2:18:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不适合当乱局中的军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a wartime consigliere.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.53,2:18:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一搬到内华达后 事情会变得更棘手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things may get rough with the move we're trying.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.96,2:18:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.34,2:19:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向麦克建议过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I advised Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.60,2:19:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未认为你不适合当军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought you were a bad consigliere.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.68,2:19:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为山提诺不适合当家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Santino was a bad Don.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:07.94,2:19:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿他安息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.19,2:19:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任麦克和你一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael has all my confidence, as you do.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.53,2:19:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不让你参与往后的行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are reasons why you must have no part.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.92,2:19:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有理由的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of what is going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.43,2:19:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多少能帮得上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I could help.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:22.17,2:19:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不着了 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.74,2:20:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在无法不去注意你的脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get over the way your face looks.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.57,2:20:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的确看起来很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really looks good.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.09,2:20:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位医生的工夫确实不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doctor did some job.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:18.86,2:20:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是凯说服你去的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who talked you into it, Kay?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:20.17,2:20:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 把它们留下这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, wait. Leave them out here.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.73,2:20:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待会再处理它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll deal with them later.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.94,2:20:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他累了 他想梳洗一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's tired. He wants to clean up.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.46,2:20:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让我来开门 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let me open the door.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.75,2:20:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 欢迎光临拉斯维加斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mike. Welcome to Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.74,2:20:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All for you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.88,2:20:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是他的主意 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all his idea, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.00,2:20:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的哥哥弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your brother, Freddy-
Dialogue: 0,2:20:41.18,2:20:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你弄来的女孩子 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Girls?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.69,2:20:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来 你先招呼一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back. You keep them occupied.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:50.98,2:20:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要什么全都有 - 那些女孩子是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That a boy. Anything you want, kid.- Who are the girls?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.98,2:20:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得要你自己去弄清楚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for you to find out.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.76,2:20:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她们弄走 弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.49,2:21:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike-
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.62,2:21:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多 我是来这公干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here on business.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:03.10,2:21:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天就走 现在把她们弄走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave tomorrow. Now, get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.70,2:21:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了 把乐队也弄走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired. Get rid of the band too.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.08,2:21:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 走就对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just take off. Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.55,2:21:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 安杰拉 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's it. Angelo, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.25,2:21:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 闪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.98,2:21:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 亲爱的 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scram! Come on, honey. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:26.06,2:21:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.15,2:21:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他是怎么回事 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell's the matter with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.79,2:21:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:31.96,2:21:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 亲爱的 我不知道 他大概累了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. He's tired, he's hot.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.59,2:21:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫格林呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Moe Greene?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:44.63,2:21:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他有别的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he had some business. He said give him a call.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.11,2:21:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说派对开始时 给他个电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the party started.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.25,2:21:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就打电话给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, give him a call.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.16,2:21:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼 你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.71,2:21:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 再看到你真高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.75,2:21:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都以你为傲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.01,2:21:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.18,2:21:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐 强尼 我要跟你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, Johnny. I want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.22,2:22:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父也以你为傲 强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Don's proud of you too.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.69,2:22:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一切都归功于他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe it all to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.78,2:22:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你会感恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he knows how grateful you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.69,2:22:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他想请你帮个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he'd like to ask a favor of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.90,2:22:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 我能做些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:13.19,2:22:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族想放弃橄榄油的生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Corleone family is thinking of giving up all its interests.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.24,2:22:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在这里安顿下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the olive oil business, settling out here.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.41,2:22:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫格林会把他旅馆 及赌场的股份卖给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Moe Greene will sell us his share of the casino and hotel.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.89,2:22:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,使得家族能拥有全部的生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it can be completely owned by the family.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.62,2:22:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.80,2:22:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 这点你确定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.70,2:22:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫格林很爱这门生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moe loves the business.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.96,2:22:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未对我提过要卖掉它的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never said nothin' to me about sellin'.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.82,2:22:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会提个他无法拒绝的条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make him an offer he can't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:34.81,2:22:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？强尼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.34,2:22:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为表演一定可以 吸引赌客到赌场来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we figure that entertainment will be a big factor in drawing gamblers to the casino.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.67,2:22:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望你签个合约 一年来此登台五次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hope you'll sign a contract to appear five times a year.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:48.27,2:22:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便找些你电影圈中的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps convince some of your friends in the movies to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:54.21,2:22:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指望你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:58.30,2:22:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.60,2:23:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了教父我什么都肯做 你晓得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do anything for my godfather. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.35,2:23:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.12,2:23:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 各位好 大家都在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike. Hello, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.73,2:23:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多 汤姆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's here. Freddy, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.89,2:23:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好 麦克 你好吗？莫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you, Mike. How are you, Moe?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:11.98,2:23:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你点的都到齐了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got everything you want?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:13.23,2:23:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大厨会为你煮最好吃的菜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chef cooked for you special,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.26,2:23:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最棒的舞群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dancers will kick your tongue out and your credit is good.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.27,2:23:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,给房间里的每个人都弄点筹码来好让他们到场子里去玩玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw chips for everybody in the room so they can play on the house.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:23.69,2:23:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的信用好的 够买下你的股份吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My credit good enough to buy you out?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.77,2:23:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,买我的股份？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy me out?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:30.16,2:23:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌场这家旅馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The casino. The hotel.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:32.90,2:23:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族想买下你全部的生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Corleone family wants to buy you out.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:35.73,2:23:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族想买下 我全部的生意？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Corleone family wants to buy me out?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.80,2:23:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我买下你们的 你不能买下我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I buy you out. You don't buy me out.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:41.41,2:23:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的赌场在赔钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your casino loses money.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.14,2:23:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能经营的好一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can do better.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.84,2:23:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我在走下坡了？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm skimming off the top?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.05,2:23:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你运气不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:53.65,2:23:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的别让我笑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You goddamn guineas really make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:56.20,2:23:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们有难时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do you a favor and take Freddy in.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.33,2:23:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你们的忙 给弗雷多一份差事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you're having a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:59.03,2:24:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你想把我弄出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you try to push me out!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.50,2:24:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:01.84,2:24:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让弗雷多来这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took Freddy in because the Corleone family.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.14,2:24:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为柯里昂家族支持你的赌场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bankrolled your casino.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.58,2:24:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为海岸的莫伦纳家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the Molinari family.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:07.45,2:24:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证他的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the coast guaranteed his safety.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.05,2:24:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们在谈生意别岔开话题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we're talkin' business. Let's talk business.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.01,2:24:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们来谈生意 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk business.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:12.32,2:24:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你们都完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, you're all done.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.75,2:24:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族已经衰退了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Corleone family don't have that kind of muscle anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.13,2:24:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父生病了 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Godfather's sick.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:17.86,2:24:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被巴西尼及其它家族 赶出了纽约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting chased out of New York by Barzini and the other families.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.69,2:24:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这里是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think is going on it?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.12,2:24:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为能到我的地盘上来接管？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can come to my hotel and take over?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:24.81,2:24:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和巴西尼谈过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to Barzini.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.37,2:24:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法和他打交道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make a deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:27.67,2:24:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不至于失去旅馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and still keep my hotel.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:29.98,2:24:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你当众支使我哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you slapped my brother around in public?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.71,2:24:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 麦克 那不算什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:35.66,2:24:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫也不是那个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moe didn't mean nothin' by that.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.35,2:24:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然他偶尔说话很大声 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure he flies off the handle once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.83,2:24:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫和我是好朋友 对吧？莫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Moe and me, we're good friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:43.18,2:24:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在做事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a business to run.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:44.87,2:24:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然要催紧点 事情才会顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta kick asses sometimes to make it run right.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:47.47,2:24:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是偶尔和弗雷多意见不合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a little argument,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.08,2:24:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是为了「训练」他一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I had to straighten him out.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.56,2:24:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你「训练」我哥哥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You straightened my brother out?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.46,2:24:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟酒廊的女侍鬼混{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was banging cocktail waitresses two at a time!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.84,2:24:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人喝酒没人送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Players couldn't get a drink.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:59.02,2:25:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:05.87,2:25:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天回纽约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave for New York tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.22,2:25:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你考虑一个价钱吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about a price.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.65,2:25:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗？我是莫格林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch. Do you know who I am? I'm Moe Greene.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.39,2:25:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发迹时你还在玩泥巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my bones when you were going out with cheerleaders.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.12,2:25:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 莫 我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:20.59,2:25:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 汤姆 你是军师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, you're the consigliere.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:22.76,2:25:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以和教父谈 解释给他听 - 慢着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can talk to the Don. You can explain - Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:24.28,2:25:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父已经半退休了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Don is semiretired. Mike is in charge of the business now.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:27.27,2:25:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族现在由麦克管事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike is in charge of the business now.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.44,2:25:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有话就向麦克说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have anything to say, say it to Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.56,2:25:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你不能到拉斯维加斯来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't come to Las Vegas and talk to Moe Greene like that!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.17,2:25:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,和莫格林那种人那样说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and talk to Moe Greene like that!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.50,2:25:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多你是我哥 我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my older brother, and I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.07,2:25:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不准你再联合外人 起来反对自己家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't ever take sides with anyone against the family again.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.97,2:25:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:04.74,2:26:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须先去看我父亲和他的手下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see my father and his people.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.47,2:26:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先吃饭吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have dinner without me.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:08.03,2:26:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.72,2:26:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个周末我们可以出外游玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This weekend we'll go out. We'll go to the city.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:12.11,2:26:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到城里看电影吃饭 我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see a show and have dinner. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:23.01,2:26:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:24.19,2:26:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你姐姐有事想问你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister wants to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:26.01,2:26:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她可以问我 - 她怕你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let her ask. - She's afraid to.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:28.23,2:26:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮和卡洛 要你当他们孩子的教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie and Carlo want you to be godfather to their little boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:31.30,2:26:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到时再说吧 - 你会吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll see. - Will you?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.21,2:26:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我考虑一下 到时再说 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me think about it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.42,2:26:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴西尼想要先对付你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Barzini will move against you first.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:47.36,2:26:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会找个你信任的人来安排见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll set up a meeting with someone that you absolutely trust.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:51.87,2:26:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,并保证你的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}guaranteeing your safety.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.08,2:26:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你一出席会议 他就杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at that meeting, you'll be assassinated.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.30,2:27:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在比以前爱喝酒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to drink wine more than I used to.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:07.43,2:27:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且越爱喝就喝的越多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I'm drinking more.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:09.72,2:27:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你有好处的 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good for you, Pop.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:16.02,2:27:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:19.53,2:27:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太太和小孩过的还快乐吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife and children, are you happy with them?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:23.34,2:27:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very happy.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:25.35,2:27:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:28.12,2:27:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不介意我一直在谈巴西尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't mind the way I I keep going over this Barzini business.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:33.08,2:27:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 一点也不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:35.07,2:27:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的老习惯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an old habit.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.46,2:27:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了一辈子就学会了「小心」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent my life tryin' not to be careless.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.14,2:27:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人和小孩能够粗心大意 但男人不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women and children can be careless, but not men.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:48.87,2:27:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你儿子还好吗？- 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's your boy? - He's good.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:51.43,2:27:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他越来越像你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he looks more like you every day.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:56.81,2:27:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比我聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's smarter than I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:59.25,2:28:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,才三岁就懂得看漫画了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years old, he can read the funny papers.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:03.32,2:28:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看漫画{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He reads the funny papers.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:12.66,2:28:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你安排一个电话公司的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to arrange to have a telephone man.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:15.01,2:28:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,查每一个进出这里的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}check all the calls that go in and out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:18.52,2:28:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经做了 爸 - 任何一个人都有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did it already. - Could be anyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:20.82,2:28:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 我已经处理那件事了 - 没错 我忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I took care of that. - That's right. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.72,2:28:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.37,2:28:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么困扰着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:35.75,2:28:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应付得了 我说能 我就能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle it. I told you I can handle it, I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:53.89,2:28:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道山提诺 势必会染指家族事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that Santino was gonna have to go through all this.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:58.28,2:29:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Fredo-
Dialogue: 0,2:29:02.84,2:29:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo was-
Dialogue: 0,2:29:06.61,2:29:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从来没没想到要你参与{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never wanted this for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:11.69,2:29:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干了一辈子 没什么遗憾的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked my whole life, I don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:13.99,2:29:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照顾了我的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take care of my family.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:16.86,2:29:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我绝不当傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I refused to be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.94,2:29:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那些大人物在幕后操纵我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dancing on a string held by all those big shots.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:26.93,2:29:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不必道歉 那是我的命运 但是我想过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't apologize. That's my life. But I thought that.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:32.13,2:29:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天你能当那些操纵的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that when it was your time you would be the one to hold the strings.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:39.17,2:29:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:42.64,2:29:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂州长之类的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governor Corleone. Something.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:44.41,2:29:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,再建立一个王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another pezzonovante.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:47.98,2:29:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 时间不多了 麦克 时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wasn't enough time. Wasn't enough time.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:56.84,2:29:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会做到的 爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get there, Pop.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.49,2:30:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会做到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:05.21,2:30:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:06.56,2:30:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁请你去和巴西尼开会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever comes to you with this Barzini meeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:09.60,2:30:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's the traitor.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:11.47,2:30:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.20,2:30:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能自己浇水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I water these.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:47.06,2:30:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以浇水吗？- 可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I water these? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:48.70,2:30:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,浇吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:51.05,2:30:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:55.56,2:30:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 别溅到了 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. You're spilling it.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:04.30,2:31:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼 过来 来吧…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony, come here.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:09.54,2:31:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:12.33,2:31:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 放在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. We'll put it right there.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.18,2:31:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 有东西给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you something.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:23.43,2:31:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:25.60,2:31:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you stand there.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:31.25,2:31:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把柳丁给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me an orange!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:51.43,2:31:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新把戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a new trick.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:54.43,2:31:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去里面 去里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run in there. Run in there.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:10.20,2:32:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪？- 谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:14.23,2:32:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:09.64,2:35:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 能借一步说话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, can I have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:21.96,2:35:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴西尼想要安排一次会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barzini wants to arrange a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:24.39,2:35:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说任何的问题都可以谈出一个解决之道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says we can straighten any of our problems out.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:28.69,2:35:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和他谈过了？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You talked to him? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.12,2:35:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能安排安全事宜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can arrange security.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:34.72,2:35:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的地盘上 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my territory. All right?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:41.06,2:35:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:59.12,2:36:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们预备怎么对付你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how they're gonna come at you?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:04.76,2:36:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们安排在布鲁克林开会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're arranging a meeting in Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:07.06,2:36:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰西欧的地盘上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessio's ground.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:10.35,2:36:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,说在那我会安全的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:24.47,2:36:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为是克里曼沙 没想到是泰西欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought it would've been Clemenza, not Tessio.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:28.16,2:36:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一招漂亮 泰西欧一向聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the smart move. Tessio was always smarter.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:34.24,2:36:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会静观其变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.83,2:36:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等洗礼过了再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the baptism.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:41.00,2:36:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定当康妮小孩的教父了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided to be godfather to Connie's baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:45.00,2:36:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我再去见巴西尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'll meet with Don Barzini.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:48.00,2:36:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有塔塔基利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Tattaglia.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:50.43,2:36:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有五大家族的族长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the heads of the five families.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:30.15,2:37:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen!
Dialogue: 0,2:39:14.24,2:39:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你相信上帝吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, do you believe in God, the Father Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:15.67,2:39:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,全能的天父 万物的创造者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}creator of Heaven and Earth?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:19.32,2:39:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:20.62,2:39:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信耶稣基督 他的独子 我们的主吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in Jesus Christ, his only Son, our Lord?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:24.05,2:39:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:25.26,2:39:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信圣灵 神圣的教堂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in the holy Ghost, the holy Catholic Church?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:29.43,2:39:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:36.27,2:40:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael Francis Rizzi,
Dialogue: 0,2:40:38.44,2:40:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弃绝撒旦吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you renounce Satan?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:47.04,2:40:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弃绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do renounce him.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:58.11,2:41:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括他所有的作为吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all his works?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:13.17,2:41:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弃绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do renounce them.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:20.15,2:41:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括他所有的虚伪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all his pomps?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:22.33,2:41:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弃绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do renounce them.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:39.56,2:41:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael Rizzi,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:41.73,2:41:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意当他的教父吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you be baptized?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:43.77,2:41:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:52.41,2:41:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael Rizzi, go in peace.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.15,2:41:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿主与你同在 阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may the Lord be with you. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:11.78,2:42:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:13.99,2:42:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your godfather.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:40.34,2:42:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡洛 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carlo. - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:42.33,2:42:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不能去拉斯维加斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't go to Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:43.72,2:42:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,临时有要事 让他们先走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's come up.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:46.46,2:42:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克 这是我们第一次度假 - 康妮 别吵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's our first vacation together. - Connie, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:49.06,2:42:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎么做？- 回家去等我电话 有要事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you wanna do? - Go back to the house. Wait for my call. It's important.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:52.14,2:42:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:54.18,2:42:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需一两天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll only be a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:59.17,2:43:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅途愉快 妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice trip, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:12.72,2:43:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去布鲁克林了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way to Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:16.97,2:43:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望麦克今晚能谈个好交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope Mike can get us a good deal tonight.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:19.54,2:43:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he will.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:28.61,2:43:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙尔 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sal, Tom,
Dialogue: 0,2:43:29.90,2:43:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板说他自己坐车来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the boss says he'll come in a separate car.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:31.86,2:43:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你们先走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says for you two to go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:33.89,2:43:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:35.07,2:43:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄乱了我所有的安排 他是这么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It screws up all my arrangements. That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:37.68,2:43:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能去 沙尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go either, Sal.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:51.78,2:43:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉麦克这纯粹是生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Mike it was only business.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:54.61,2:43:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都喜欢他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always liked him.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:57.17,2:43:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会了解的 沙尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He understands that.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:58.42,2:44:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了 沙尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Sal.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:06.37,2:44:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 能替我求个情吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get me off the hook?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:09.88,2:44:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看在老交情的份上 - 我做不到 沙尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For old times' sake. - Can't do it, Sally.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:58.50,2:45:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得为山尼的事偿命 卡洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to answer for Santino, Carlo.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:06.32,2:45:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会了 麦克 你为巴西尼的人设计害山尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it all wrong. You fingered Sonny for the Barzini people.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:11.22,2:45:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我姐姐演的那场闹剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little farce you played with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:15.13,2:45:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为骗得过柯里昂家的人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think that could fool a Corleone?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:17.08,2:45:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 我是清白的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:18.38,2:45:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以我的孩子来发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear on the kids.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:20.15,2:45:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你 麦克 别这样对我 - 坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, don't do this to me. - Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:25.94,2:45:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 别这样对我 求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to me, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:37.40,2:45:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴西尼死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barzini's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:40.99,2:45:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲立浦塔塔基利亚也死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is Phillip Tattaglia.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:44.78,2:45:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有莫格林 史特基 克瑞安诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moe Greene Strachi Cuneo.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:52.59,2:45:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我一次清理整个家族的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today I settle all family business,
Dialogue: 0,2:45:54.45,2:45:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别跟我说你是无辜的 卡洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so don't tell me you're innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:58.18,2:46:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认你所做过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admit what you did.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:03.92,2:46:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他一杯酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him a drink.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:11.99,2:46:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:14.37,2:46:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 卡洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:16.98,2:46:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我忍心让我姐姐当寡妇？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'd make my sister a widow?
Dialogue: 0,2:46:20.93,2:46:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又是你儿子的教父 卡洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm godfather to your son.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:30.65,2:46:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, drink.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:37.56,2:46:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛 从此你退出家族的生意 这是给你的惩罚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're out of the family business. That's your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:42.37,2:46:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩完了 我送你上飞机去拉斯维加斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're finished. I'm putting you on a plane to Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:46.46,2:46:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:52.27,2:46:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你留在那边 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to stay there. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,2:46:55.88,2:46:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是别告诉我 你是无辜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only don't tell me you're innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:59.83,2:47:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那等于把我当傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it insults my intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:02.90,2:47:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让我非常生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me very angry.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:08.25,2:47:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 是谁和你接头的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who approached you?
Dialogue: 0,2:47:11.55,2:47:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔塔基利亚还是巴西尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tattaglia or Barzini?
Dialogue: 0,2:47:21.79,2:47:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巴西尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Barzini.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:27.69,2:47:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:35.33,2:47:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有辆车等着送你去机场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a car waiting for you outside to take you to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:39.41,2:47:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通知你太太说你坐那班飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call your wife, tell her what flight you're on.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:47.41,2:47:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克 我… - 快走 别让我看到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, can I… - Get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:16.04,2:48:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Carlo.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:15.52,2:49:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想告诉我什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop crying? What are you trying to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:17.52,2:49:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想告诉你 - 妈妈 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm telling you you're wrong. - Mama, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:49:28.98,2:49:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:31.24,2:49:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？他在哪儿？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:35.62,2:49:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你这混蛋 你杀了我丈夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, you lousy bastard! You killed my husband!
Dialogue: 0,2:49:40.61,2:49:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看爸一死 就没人能管你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You waited until Papa died so nobody could stop you.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:43.42,2:49:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就把他杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you killed him!
Dialogue: 0,2:49:44.86,2:49:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直把山尼的死怪在他身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blamed him for Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:46.59,2:49:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直如此 大家都如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did. Everybody did.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:47.94,2:49:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你有没有想过我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you never thought about me!
Dialogue: 0,2:49:49.90,2:49:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不在乎我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never gave a damn about me!
Dialogue: 0,2:49:51.89,2:49:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以后要怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:54.06,2:49:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:57.93,2:50:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他为何要卡洛在他身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think he kept Carlo at the mall?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:00.66,2:50:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早就算计好要杀他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the time he knew he was gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:03.58,2:50:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是我孩子的教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you stood godfather to our baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:06.57,2:50:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个冷酷的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lousy, coldhearted bastard.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:09.13,2:50:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道除了卡洛 他还杀过多少人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to know how many men he had killed with Carlo?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:11.56,2:50:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看报纸吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read the papers! Read the papers!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:13.08,2:50:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你丈夫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your husband! That's your husband!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:25.79,2:50:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:29.92,2:50:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她上楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:32.17,2:50:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找医生来 - 噢 上帝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her a doctor. - Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:54.44,2:50:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她神经错乱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:00.82,2:51:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,歇斯底里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:04.38,2:51:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 是真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:08.20,2:51:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你说过别管公事 凯 - 是真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't ask me about my business, Kay. - Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:11.81,2:51:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过问我的公事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask me about my business.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:13.59,2:51:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,2:51:34.76,2:51:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:39.11,2:51:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只此一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one time.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:44.83,2:51:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我让你问吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one time, I'll let you ask me about my affairs.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:54.39,2:51:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:03.08,2:52:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:18.17,2:52:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们两个都需要喝一杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we both need a drink, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:20.61,2:52:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:52.55,2:52:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone.
